window.IELTS_TOPIC={"topic":2,"en":"Wildlife Conservation & Endangered Species","zh":"野生動物保育與瀕危物種","items":[{"w":"species","pos":"n.","def":"a group of animals or plants of the same kind","cn":"物種","s":"Scientists discovered a new ________ of frog in the mountains of Taiwan, and they are now studying how it survives the cold winters.","zh":"科學家在台灣山區發現了一種新的青蛙物種，他們現在正在研究牠如何度過寒冷的冬天。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A1","t":"物種"},{"w":"endangered","pos":"adj.","def":"in danger of disappearing forever","cn":"瀕臨絕種的","s":"The Formosan clouded leopard was once an ________ animal in Taiwan, but sadly no one has seen one in the wild for many years.","zh":"台灣雲豹曾經是台灣瀕臨絕種的動物，但遺憾的是，已經很多年沒有人在野外見過牠了。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A2","t":"瀕臨絕種的"},{"w":"extinct","pos":"adj.","def":"no longer existing anywhere in the world","cn":"絕種的","s":"Dinosaurs have been ________ for about 66 million years, so we can only learn about them from fossils and bones.","zh":"恐龍已經絕種大約六千六百萬年了，所以我們只能從化石和骨頭來認識牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A3","t":"絕種"},{"w":"extinction","pos":"n.","def":"the situation when a species no longer exists","cn":"滅絕","s":"Many frogs around the world face ________ because a deadly disease is spreading quickly, and scientists are racing to find a cure.","zh":"世界各地許多青蛙正面臨滅絕，因為一種致命的疾病正在迅速擴散，而科學家們正爭分奪秒地尋找解藥。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A4","t":"滅絕"},{"w":"biodiversity","pos":"n.","def":"the variety of plants and animals in one place","cn":"生物多樣性","s":"Coral reefs have amazing ________ because thousands of fish and sea creatures live there, so protecting them is very important.","zh":"珊瑚礁擁有驚人的生物多樣性，因為有成千上萬種魚類和海洋生物住在那裡，所以保護它們非常重要。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A5","t":"生物多樣性"},{"w":"mammal","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that feeds its babies with milk","cn":"哺乳動物","s":"A whale looks like a giant fish, but it is actually a ________ because it breathes air and feeds its babies with milk.","zh":"鯨魚看起來像一條巨大的魚，但牠其實是一種哺乳動物，因為牠呼吸空氣並用乳汁餵養寶寶。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A6","t":"哺乳動物"},{"w":"reptile","pos":"n.","def":"a cold-blooded animal with dry skin, like a snake","cn":"爬蟲類動物","s":"A turtle is a ________ that lays its eggs on the beach, and the baby turtles must run to the sea after they hatch.","zh":"烏龜是一種會在海灘上產卵的爬蟲類動物，而小海龜孵化後必須奔向大海。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A7","t":"爬蟲類動物"},{"w":"amphibian","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that lives both in water and on land","cn":"兩棲動物","s":"A frog is an ________ because it begins life in the water as a tadpole, but later it can also live on land.","zh":"青蛙是一種兩棲動物，因為牠一開始以蝌蚪的形態生活在水中，但之後也能在陸地上生活。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A8","t":"兩棲動物"},{"w":"primate","pos":"n.","def":"a group of animals that includes monkeys, apes and humans","cn":"靈長類動物","s":"The Formosan rock macaque is the only wild ________ in Taiwan, and you can often see groups of them at Shoushan in Kaohsiung.","zh":"台灣獼猴是台灣唯一的野生靈長類動物，你常常可以在高雄的壽山看到成群的牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A9","t":"靈長類動物"},{"w":"rodent","pos":"n.","def":"a small animal with sharp front teeth, like a mouse","cn":"囓齒動物","s":"A squirrel is a ________ with strong front teeth, so it can easily break open hard nuts and seeds in the forest.","zh":"松鼠是一種前齒很強壯的囓齒動物，所以牠能輕易地咬開森林裡堅硬的堅果和種子。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A10","t":"囓齒動物"},{"w":"marsupial","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that carries its baby in a pouch","cn":"有袋動物","s":"The kangaroo is the most famous ________ in Australia, and the mother carries her tiny baby in a pouch for several months.","zh":"袋鼠是澳洲最有名的有袋動物，而母袋鼠會把小小的寶寶放在育兒袋裡好幾個月。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A11","t":"有袋動物"},{"w":"carnivore","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that eats meat","cn":"肉食性動物","s":"A lion is a ________ that hunts zebras and other large animals, so it needs to eat a lot of meat to stay strong.","zh":"獅子是一種會獵捕斑馬和其他大型動物的肉食性動物，所以牠需要吃大量的肉才能保持強壯。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A12","t":"肉食性動物"},{"w":"herbivore","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that eats only plants","cn":"草食性動物","s":"The giant panda is mostly a ________ because it eats bamboo almost all day, although it sometimes eats small animals too.","zh":"大貓熊大多是草食性動物，因為牠幾乎整天都在吃竹子，雖然牠偶爾也會吃小動物。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A13","t":"草食性動物"},{"w":"omnivore","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that eats both plants and meat","cn":"雜食性動物","s":"A bear is an ________ that eats fruit, insects and fish, so it can find food easily in different seasons.","zh":"熊是一種會吃水果、昆蟲和魚的雜食性動物，所以牠在不同季節都能輕易找到食物。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A14","t":"雜食性動物"},{"w":"predator","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that hunts and kills other animals","cn":"掠食者","s":"The eagle is a powerful ________ in the sky, and small birds hide in the bushes whenever they see its shadow.","zh":"老鷹是天空中強大的掠食者，每當小鳥看到牠的影子就會躲進灌木叢裡。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A15","t":"掠食者"},{"w":"prey","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that is hunted and eaten by another","cn":"獵物","s":"Rabbits are common ________ for foxes and owls, so they always stay alert and run quickly when they hear a strange noise.","zh":"兔子是狐狸和貓頭鷹常見的獵物，所以牠們總是保持警覺，一聽到奇怪的聲音就會快速逃跑。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A16","t":"獵物"},{"w":"vertebrate","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that has a backbone","cn":"脊椎動物","s":"Fish, birds and humans are all ________ because they have a backbone, but worms and jellyfish do not have one.","zh":"魚、鳥和人類都是脊椎動物，因為牠們有脊椎骨，但蟲和水母則沒有。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A17","t":"脊椎動物"},{"w":"invertebrate","pos":"n.","def":"an animal without a backbone","cn":"無脊椎動物","s":"An octopus is a clever ________ that has no bones at all, so it can squeeze through very small holes.","zh":"章魚是一種聰明的無脊椎動物，牠完全沒有骨頭，所以能擠過非常小的洞。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A18","t":"無脊椎動物"},{"w":"subspecies","pos":"n.","def":"a smaller group within a species","cn":"亞種","s":"The Formosan black bear is a ________ of the Asian black bear, and it has a white V-shaped mark on its chest.","zh":"台灣黑熊是亞洲黑熊的一個亞種，牠的胸前有一個白色的V字形斑紋。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A19","t":"亞種"},{"w":"wildlife","pos":"n.","def":"animals and plants that live in nature","cn":"野生動植物","s":"Kenting National Park is full of ________, so visitors often see colourful birds, butterflies and even wild deer during their trip.","zh":"墾丁國家公園充滿了野生動植物，所以遊客在旅途中常常能看見色彩繽紛的鳥、蝴蝶，甚至野鹿。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A20","t":"野生動植物"},{"w":"fauna","pos":"n.","def":"all the animals living in a particular area","cn":"動物群；某地區的動物","s":"The ________ of Madagascar is very special because about ninety percent of its animals cannot be found anywhere else on Earth.","zh":"馬達加斯加的動物群非常特別，因為那裡大約百分之九十的動物在地球上其他地方都找不到。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A21","t":"動物群"},{"w":"flora","pos":"n.","def":"all the plants growing in a particular area","cn":"植物群；某地區的植物","s":"The guide explained the local ________ to us during the hike, and we learned that some flowers only bloom in high mountains.","zh":"嚮導在健行途中向我們介紹當地的植物，我們得知有些花只在高山上開花。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A22","t":"植物"},{"w":"organism","pos":"n.","def":"a living thing, such as a plant or animal","cn":"生物；有機體","s":"Even the smallest ________ in a pond plays a role in nature, because bigger animals depend on it for food.","zh":"即使是池塘中最小的生物在大自然中也扮演一個角色，因為較大的動物依賴牠作為食物。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A23","t":"生物"},{"w":"specimen","pos":"n.","def":"an example of an animal or plant kept for study","cn":"標本；樣本","s":"The museum keeps a ________ of an extinct bird in a glass box, so students can see what it looked like long ago.","zh":"博物館把一隻已滅絕鳥類的標本保存在玻璃盒裡，讓學生們能看到牠很久以前的模樣。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A24","t":"標本"},{"w":"rare","pos":"adj.","def":"not seen or found very often","cn":"稀有的","s":"The Mikado pheasant is a ________ bird that lives only in Taiwan's high mountains, so photographers wait for hours to take its picture.","zh":"帝雉是一種只生活在台灣高山的稀有鳥類，所以攝影師們會等上好幾個小時只為了拍到牠。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A25","t":"稀有"},{"w":"endemic","pos":"adj.","def":"found naturally in only one place","cn":"特有的","s":"The Taiwan blue magpie is ________ to Taiwan, which means you cannot see this beautiful bird in the wild in any other country.","zh":"台灣藍鵲是台灣特有的鳥類，這表示你在其他任何國家的野外都看不到這種美麗的鳥。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A26","t":"特有的"},{"w":"indigenous","pos":"adj.","def":"belonging naturally to a place; original","cn":"原生的；本土的","s":"Farmers planted ________ trees along the river instead of foreign ones, because local birds and insects depend on them.","zh":"農夫們沿著河岸種植原生樹木而不是外來樹種，因為當地的鳥類和昆蟲依賴它們生存。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A27","t":"原生"},{"w":"nocturnal","pos":"adj.","def":"active at night and sleeping during the day","cn":"夜行性的","s":"Owls are ________ birds that hunt mice in the dark, so you rarely see them flying around during the day.","zh":"貓頭鷹是在黑暗中獵捕老鼠的夜行性鳥類，所以你很少在白天看到牠們飛來飛去。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A28","t":"夜行性"},{"w":"flightless","pos":"adj.","def":"not able to fly","cn":"不會飛的","s":"The kakapo is a ________ parrot from New Zealand, so it walks and climbs trees instead of flying away from danger.","zh":"鴞鸚鵡是一種來自紐西蘭的不會飛的鸚鵡，所以牠遇到危險時是用走和爬樹的方式，而不是飛走。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A29","t":"不會飛的"},{"w":"pollinator","pos":"n.","def":"an insect or animal that carries pollen between flowers","cn":"授粉者","s":"The bee is an important ________ for many fruit trees, so farmers worry when the number of bees goes down.","zh":"蜜蜂是許多果樹重要的授粉者，所以當蜜蜂數量減少時，農夫們就會擔心。","part":"A","sec":"Species & Biodiversity 物種與生物多樣性","lab":"A30","t":"授粉者"},{"w":"habitat","pos":"n.","def":"the natural home of an animal or plant","cn":"棲地；棲息地","s":"When a forest is cut down, many animals lose their ________, and they have to search for a new place to live.","zh":"當森林被砍伐時，許多動物就失去了牠們的棲息地，而且必須尋找新的地方居住。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A31","t":"棲息地"},{"w":"ecosystem","pos":"n.","def":"all the living things in an area and how they connect","cn":"生態系統","s":"If one animal disappears from an ________, other animals and plants may also be affected because they all depend on each other.","zh":"如果一種動物從一個生態系統中消失，其他動植物也可能受到影響，因為牠們都互相依賴。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A32","t":"生態系統"},{"w":"ecology","pos":"n.","def":"the study of how living things relate to their environment","cn":"生態學","s":"My sister studies ________ at university, and she often goes to the wetlands to count birds and test the water.","zh":"我姊姊在大學念生態學，她常常去濕地數鳥並檢測水質。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A33","t":"生態學"},{"w":"ecological","pos":"adj.","def":"related to plants, animals and their environment","cn":"生態的","s":"Building a new road through the forest could cause serious ________ damage, so many local people are against the plan.","zh":"在森林中蓋一條新道路可能造成嚴重的生態破壞，所以許多當地居民反對這項計畫。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A34","t":"生態"},{"w":"rainforest","pos":"n.","def":"a thick tropical forest with heavy rain all year","cn":"雨林","s":"The Amazon ________ is home to millions of insects and animals, but large areas of it are cut down every year.","zh":"亞馬遜雨林是數百萬種昆蟲和動物的家園，但每年都有大片面積遭到砍伐。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A35","t":"雨林"},{"w":"wetland","pos":"n.","def":"land that is wet, such as a marsh or swamp","cn":"濕地","s":"The black-faced spoonbills spend the winter in the ________ of Tainan, so many birdwatchers visit the area every year.","zh":"黑面琵鷺在台南的濕地過冬，所以每年都有許多賞鳥人士造訪那個地區。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A36","t":"濕地"},{"w":"grassland","pos":"n.","def":"a large area of land covered with grass","cn":"草原","s":"Zebras and antelopes live on the African ________, and they travel long distances every year to find fresh grass and water.","zh":"斑馬和羚羊生活在非洲的草原上，牠們每年都要長途跋涉尋找新鮮的草和水。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A37","t":"草原"},{"w":"savannah","pos":"n.","def":"a flat grassy plain in a hot country with few trees","cn":"熱帶大草原","s":"Lions rest under the trees of the ________ during the hot afternoon, and they usually hunt when the sun goes down.","zh":"獅子在炎熱的午後於熱帶大草原的樹下休息，而牠們通常在太陽下山後才狩獵。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A38","t":"熱帶大草原"},{"w":"tundra","pos":"n.","def":"a cold, flat area with no trees near the Arctic","cn":"凍原；苔原","s":"The Arctic ________ is frozen for most of the year, but in summer it becomes green and many birds fly there to lay eggs.","zh":"北極凍原一年中大部分時間都是冰凍的，但到了夏天就會變綠，許多鳥會飛到那裡產卵。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A39","t":"凍原"},{"w":"coral","pos":"n.","def":"a hard sea substance made by tiny sea animals","cn":"珊瑚","s":"When the sea becomes too warm, ________ turns white and may die, so divers are worried about the future of the reefs.","zh":"當海水變得太暖時，珊瑚會變白甚至死亡，所以潛水員們很擔心珊瑚礁的未來。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A40","t":"珊瑚"},{"w":"reef","pos":"n.","def":"a line of rock or coral near the surface of the sea","cn":"礁；暗礁","s":"We went snorkelling near a ________ in Green Island, and we saw colourful fish swimming between the rocks.","zh":"我們在綠島的一處珊瑚礁附近浮潛，看到了色彩繽紛的魚在岩石之間游來游去。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A41","t":"珊瑚礁"},{"w":"mangrove","pos":"n.","def":"a tree that grows in salty water along coasts","cn":"紅樹林","s":"The ________ along the coast protect the land from strong waves, and they also give young fish a safe place to grow.","zh":"海岸邊的紅樹林保護陸地免受大浪侵襲，同時也提供小魚一個安全成長的地方。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A42","t":"紅樹林"},{"w":"estuary","pos":"n.","def":"the wide part of a river where it meets the sea","cn":"河口","s":"The Danshui River ________ is full of crabs and birds, because fresh water and sea water mix there and bring plenty of food.","zh":"淡水河河口充滿了螃蟹和鳥類，因為淡水和海水在那裡交會，帶來了豐富的食物。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A43","t":"河口"},{"w":"canopy","pos":"n.","def":"the top layer of branches and leaves in a forest","cn":"樹冠層","s":"Many monkeys spend their whole lives in the forest ________, so they rarely come down to the ground.","zh":"許多猴子一生都待在森林的樹冠層，所以牠們很少下到地面上。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A44","t":"樹冠層"},{"w":"undergrowth","pos":"n.","def":"bushes and small plants growing under big trees","cn":"矮樹叢；下層灌木","s":"The small deer hid in the thick ________ when it heard our footsteps, so we could not take a photo of it.","zh":"小鹿聽到我們的腳步聲就躲進了茂密的矮樹叢裡，所以我們沒辦法拍到牠的照片。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A45","t":"矮樹叢"},{"w":"burrow","pos":"n.","def":"a hole in the ground that an animal digs to live in","cn":"地洞；洞穴","s":"The pangolin digs a deep ________ under the ground, and it sleeps there during the day to stay cool and safe.","zh":"穿山甲在地底下挖了一個很深的洞穴，白天牠就在那裡睡覺，以保持涼爽和安全。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A46","t":"洞穴"},{"w":"nest","pos":"n.","def":"a home that birds build for their eggs","cn":"巢；鳥巢","s":"A pair of swallows built a ________ under our balcony, and we watched the parents feed their babies every morning.","zh":"一對燕子在我們的陽台下築了一個巢，我們每天早上都看著燕子爸媽餵食牠們的寶寶。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A47","t":"巢"},{"w":"den","pos":"n.","def":"the hidden home of a wild animal such as a bear","cn":"獸穴；巢穴","s":"The mother bear stays in her ________ all winter, and her cubs are born there while the snow covers the forest.","zh":"熊媽媽整個冬天都待在她的巢穴裡，而當白雪覆蓋森林時，她的小熊就在那裡出生。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A48","t":"巢穴"},{"w":"territory","pos":"n.","def":"an area that an animal treats as its own","cn":"領域；地盤","s":"A male tiger marks its ________ with its smell, and it will fight any other tiger that tries to enter.","zh":"公老虎會用氣味標示牠的地盤，而且會和任何試圖闖入的其他老虎打鬥。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A49","t":"地盤"},{"w":"niche","pos":"n.","def":"the special role of a species in its environment","cn":"生態棲位","s":"Each bird on the island has its own ________, because some eat seeds while others catch insects, so they do not compete for food.","zh":"島上每種鳥都有自己的生態棲位，因為有些吃種子，有些捕捉昆蟲，所以牠們不會爭奪食物。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A50","t":"生態棲位"},{"w":"migration","pos":"n.","def":"the seasonal movement of animals to another place","cn":"遷徙","s":"The ________ of the purple crow butterflies in Taiwan is famous, so the government closes some highway lanes to protect them every spring.","zh":"台灣紫斑蝶的遷徙非常有名，所以政府每年春天都會封閉部分高速公路車道來保護牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A51","t":"遷徙"},{"w":"migrate","pos":"v.","def":"to travel to another place when the season changes","cn":"遷徙；遷移","s":"Gray-faced buzzards ________ through Kenting every autumn, and thousands of birdwatchers gather there to watch them fly across the sky.","zh":"每年秋天灰面鵟鷹會遷徙經過墾丁，成千上萬的賞鳥人士聚集在那裡觀看牠們飛越天空。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A52","t":"遷徙"},{"w":"hibernate","pos":"v.","def":"to sleep through the whole winter","cn":"冬眠","s":"Some bears ________ during the cold months because food is hard to find, and they live on the fat stored in their bodies.","zh":"有些熊會在寒冷的月份冬眠，因為食物很難找到，牠們靠著儲存在體內的脂肪維生。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A53","t":"冬眠"},{"w":"hibernation","pos":"n.","def":"a long sleep that some animals have in winter","cn":"冬眠","s":"After a long ________, the hedgehog woke up very hungry, so it searched the garden for insects and worms.","zh":"經過漫長的冬眠後，刺蝟醒來時非常飢餓，所以牠在花園裡四處尋找昆蟲和蟲子。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A54","t":"冬眠"},{"w":"ecologist","pos":"n.","def":"a scientist who studies living things and their environment","cn":"生態學家","s":"The ________ spent three months in the mountains, and she recorded every type of bird she saw in her notebook.","zh":"那位生態學家在山上待了三個月，她把看到的每一種鳥都記錄在筆記本上。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A55","t":"生態學家"},{"w":"terrain","pos":"n.","def":"an area of land and its physical features","cn":"地形；地勢","s":"The rangers use horses instead of cars because the ________ is rocky and steep, and there are no proper roads.","zh":"巡山員們騎馬而不是開車，因為那裡的地形多岩石又陡峭，而且沒有像樣的道路。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A56","t":"地形"},{"w":"vegetation","pos":"n.","def":"plants in general, especially in one area","cn":"植被；植物","s":"After the heavy rain, the ________ on the hills grew quickly, so the deer had plenty of fresh leaves to eat.","zh":"大雨過後，山坡上的植被迅速生長，所以鹿有大量新鮮的葉子可以吃。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A57","t":"植被"},{"w":"waterhole","pos":"n.","def":"a pool of water where wild animals go to drink","cn":"水坑；飲水處","s":"During the dry season, elephants walk for hours to reach a ________, but lions often wait there to catch other animals.","zh":"在乾季時，大象要走好幾個小時才能到達水坑，但獅子常常在那裡等著捕捉其他動物。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A58","t":"水坑"},{"w":"marine","pos":"adj.","def":"related to the sea and the animals in it","cn":"海洋的","s":"Plastic bags are a serious danger to ________ animals, because turtles often think the bags are jellyfish and eat them.","zh":"塑膠袋對海洋動物是嚴重的危害，因為海龜常常把塑膠袋誤認為水母而吃下去。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A59","t":"海洋"},{"w":"scavenger","pos":"n.","def":"an animal that eats dead animals it did not kill","cn":"食腐動物","s":"The vulture is a ________ that eats dead animals, so it helps to keep the savannah clean and stops diseases from spreading.","zh":"禿鷹是一種吃動物屍體的食腐動物，所以牠幫助維持草原的乾淨，並防止疾病擴散。","part":"A","sec":"Habitats & Ecosystems 棲地與生態系","lab":"A60","t":"食腐動物"},{"w":"threat","pos":"n.","def":"something that may cause harm or danger","cn":"威脅","s":"Stray dogs are a serious ________ to wild birds in the park, because they often chase and attack birds that nest on the ground.","zh":"流浪狗對公園裡的野鳥是嚴重的威脅，因為牠們常常追逐並攻擊在地面築巢的鳥。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A61","t":"威脅"},{"w":"threaten","pos":"v.","def":"to put something in danger","cn":"威脅；危及","s":"Rising sea levels ________ the nesting beaches of sea turtles, and some beaches may disappear completely in the future.","zh":"海平面上升威脅到海龜的築巢海灘，而有些海灘未來可能會完全消失。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A62","t":"威脅"},{"w":"deforestation","pos":"n.","def":"the cutting down of forests on a large scale","cn":"森林砍伐","s":"________ in Southeast Asia has destroyed the homes of orangutans, so their numbers have fallen sharply in the past thirty years.","zh":"東南亞的森林砍伐摧毀了紅毛猩猩的家園，所以牠們的數量在過去三十年間急遽下降。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A63","t":"森林砍伐"},{"w":"logging","pos":"n.","def":"the business of cutting down trees for wood","cn":"伐木","s":"Illegal ________ continues in some national parks, because the wood is valuable and the forests are too large to guard.","zh":"非法伐木在一些國家公園仍持續發生，因為木材很值錢，而森林又大到難以看守。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A64","t":"伐木"},{"w":"destruction","pos":"n.","def":"the act of damaging something so badly it cannot be used","cn":"破壞；毀滅","s":"The ________ of wetlands for new factories has left many birds with nowhere to rest during their long journey.","zh":"為了蓋新工廠而破壞濕地，讓許多鳥類在漫長的旅程中無處歇息。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A65","t":"破壞"},{"w":"destroy","pos":"v.","def":"to damage something so badly that it cannot be used","cn":"摧毀；破壞","s":"The forest fire ________ thousands of trees last summer, and many koalas lost their homes and food.","zh":"去年夏天的森林大火摧毀了數千棵樹，許多無尾熊因此失去了家園和食物。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A66","t":"摧毀"},{"w":"fragmentation","pos":"n.","def":"the breaking of a large area into small separate parts","cn":"破碎化；分割","s":"Habitat ________ is a big problem for leopards, because new roads divide the forest into small pieces and the cats cannot meet each other.","zh":"棲地破碎化對豹來說是個大問題，因為新道路把森林分割成小塊，使這些貓科動物無法彼此相遇。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A67","t":"破碎化"},{"w":"encroach","pos":"v.","def":"to slowly take over land that belongs to others","cn":"侵占；侵入","s":"As cities grow, houses ________ on the forest, so monkeys sometimes come into people's kitchens to look for food.","zh":"隨著城市擴張，房屋侵占了森林，所以猴子有時候會跑進人們的廚房找食物。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A68","t":"侵占"},{"w":"urbanisation","pos":"n.","def":"the growth of towns and cities","cn":"都市化","s":"Rapid ________ has replaced many rice fields with tall buildings, so frogs and egrets have fewer places to live.","zh":"快速的都市化使許多稻田被高樓取代，所以青蛙和白鷺鷥能居住的地方變少了。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A69","t":"都市化"},{"w":"pesticide","pos":"n.","def":"a chemical used to kill insects that harm crops","cn":"殺蟲劑；農藥","s":"Farmers used too much ________ on their vegetables, and as a result many bees and birds near the farm died.","zh":"農夫們在蔬菜上使用了太多農藥，結果農場附近許多蜜蜂和鳥都死了。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A70","t":"農藥"},{"w":"poison","pos":"v.","def":"to harm or kill with a dangerous substance","cn":"毒害；下毒","s":"Some farmers ________ rats in their fields, but owls and eagles then eat the dead rats and become sick.","zh":"有些農夫在田裡毒殺老鼠，但貓頭鷹和老鷹接著吃了死老鼠就會生病。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A71","t":"毒殺"},{"w":"contamination","pos":"n.","def":"the process of making something dirty or harmful","cn":"汙染","s":"Water ________ from a nearby factory killed hundreds of fish in the river, so the villagers asked the government to take action.","zh":"附近工廠造成的水質汙染害死了河裡數百條魚，所以村民們要求政府採取行動。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A72","t":"汙染"},{"w":"contaminate","pos":"v.","def":"to make something dirty or poisonous","cn":"汙染","s":"Oil from the broken ship began to ________ the beach, and volunteers rushed to clean the feathers of the seabirds.","zh":"破損船隻漏出的油開始汙染海灘，志工們趕緊去清洗海鳥的羽毛。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A73","t":"汙染"},{"w":"plastic","pos":"n.","def":"a light material made from chemicals, used for bags and bottles","cn":"塑膠","s":"Scientists found pieces of ________ inside the stomach of a dead whale, so they asked people to stop using so many straws and bags.","zh":"科學家在一隻死去的鯨魚胃裡發現了塑膠碎片，所以他們呼籲大家不要再使用那麼多吸管和塑膠袋。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A74","t":"塑膠"},{"w":"debris","pos":"n.","def":"broken pieces of rubbish that are left behind","cn":"碎片；殘骸；垃圾","s":"After the typhoon, the beach was covered with ________, and a young turtle was found trapped in an old fishing net.","zh":"颱風過後，海灘上布滿了垃圾碎片，還發現一隻小海龜被困在舊漁網裡。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A75","t":"垃圾碎片"},{"w":"invasive","pos":"adj.","def":"spreading quickly and harming the local plants or animals","cn":"入侵的；外來入侵的","s":"The green iguana is an ________ species in southern Taiwan, because it eats farmers' crops and has no natural enemies here.","zh":"綠鬣蜥在台灣南部是一種外來入侵物種，因為牠會吃農作物，而且在這裡沒有天敵。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A76","t":"外來入侵"},{"w":"outbreak","pos":"n.","def":"the sudden start of a disease","cn":"爆發","s":"An ________ of bird flu forced the zoo to close for two weeks, while the vets tested all the birds.","zh":"禽流感的爆發迫使動物園關閉兩週，同時獸醫們為所有鳥類進行檢測。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A77","t":"爆發"},{"w":"starvation","pos":"n.","def":"suffering or death caused by having no food","cn":"飢餓；餓死","s":"Many polar bears face ________ because the sea ice melts earlier each year, so they cannot hunt seals for long enough.","zh":"許多北極熊面臨餓死的危機，因為海冰每年都更早融化，所以牠們無法有足夠長的時間獵捕海豹。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A78","t":"餓死"},{"w":"starve","pos":"v.","def":"to suffer or die because there is no food","cn":"挨餓；餓死","s":"If the bamboo forests keep disappearing, the pandas will ________, because bamboo makes up almost all of their food.","zh":"如果竹林持續消失，貓熊就會餓死，因為竹子幾乎是牠們全部的食物。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A79","t":"餓死"},{"w":"drought","pos":"n.","def":"a long period with little or no rain","cn":"乾旱","s":"The long ________ dried up the rivers in Kenya, and hundreds of elephants died because they could not find water.","zh":"漫長的乾旱使肯亞的河流乾涸，數百頭大象因為找不到水而死亡。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A80","t":"乾旱"},{"w":"wildfire","pos":"n.","def":"a large fire that spreads quickly in forests","cn":"野火；森林大火","s":"The ________ in Australia spread very fast because of the strong wind, and millions of animals could not escape in time.","zh":"澳洲的野火因為強風而蔓延得非常快，數百萬隻動物來不及逃生。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A81","t":"野火"},{"w":"overfishing","pos":"n.","def":"catching too many fish so their number falls","cn":"過度捕撈","s":"________ has made sharks much harder to find, because boats catch them faster than they can produce babies.","zh":"過度捕撈讓鯊魚越來越難找到，因為漁船捕捉牠們的速度比牠們繁殖的速度還快。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A82","t":"過度捕撈"},{"w":"bycatch","pos":"n.","def":"sea animals caught by accident while fishing","cn":"混獲；意外捕獲的漁獲","s":"Dolphins often become ________ in large fishing nets, so some fishermen now use special nets that let them escape.","zh":"海豚常常在大型漁網中成為混獲，所以有些漁民現在使用能讓牠們逃脫的特殊漁網。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A83","t":"混獲"},{"w":"collision","pos":"n.","def":"an accident when two things hit each other","cn":"碰撞；相撞","s":"A ________ with a fast boat badly hurt the manatee, so the rescue team took it to an animal hospital.","zh":"與快艇的碰撞讓那隻海牛受了重傷，所以救援團隊把牠送到動物醫院。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A84","t":"碰撞"},{"w":"roadkill","pos":"n.","def":"animals killed by cars on roads","cn":"路殺","s":"________ is a big problem for leopard cats in Miaoli, so the government put up warning signs along the mountain roads.","zh":"路殺對苗栗的石虎是一大問題，所以政府在山區道路沿線設置了警告標誌。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A85","t":"路殺"},{"w":"erosion","pos":"n.","def":"the slow wearing away of land by water or wind","cn":"侵蝕","s":"Beach ________ is making the turtles' nesting areas smaller, and the eggs may be washed away by big waves.","zh":"海灘侵蝕正使海龜的築巢區域變小，而且蛋可能會被大浪沖走。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A86","t":"侵蝕"},{"w":"dwindle","pos":"v.","def":"to become gradually smaller in number","cn":"逐漸減少","s":"The number of wild tigers has ________ over the last century, but some countries are now working hard to protect them.","zh":"野生老虎的數量在過去一個世紀逐漸減少，但有些國家現在正努力保護牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A87","t":"逐漸減少"},{"w":"drain","pos":"v.","def":"to remove the water from an area","cn":"排乾（水）","s":"The company wanted to ________ the marsh to build a parking lot, but the birdwatchers protested because thousands of birds rest there.","zh":"那家公司想排乾沼澤的水來蓋停車場，但賞鳥人士提出抗議，因為有成千上萬隻鳥在那裡休息。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A88","t":"排乾"},{"w":"pollutant","pos":"n.","def":"a substance that makes air, water or land dirty","cn":"汙染物","s":"The factory released a dangerous ________ into the river, and soon the fish and frogs began to disappear.","zh":"那家工廠把一種危險的汙染物排進河裡，不久之後魚和青蛙就開始消失了。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A89","t":"汙染物"},{"w":"vanish","pos":"v.","def":"to disappear suddenly or completely","cn":"消失","s":"Many small birds have ________ from the island since rats arrived on ships, because the rats eat their eggs.","zh":"自從老鼠搭船來到島上後，許多小鳥就從島上消失了，因為老鼠會吃牠們的蛋。","part":"A","sec":"Threats to Wildlife 野生動物面臨的威脅","lab":"A90","t":"消失"},{"w":"poach","pos":"v.","def":"to hunt or catch animals illegally","cn":"盜獵","s":"Criminals ________ elephants for their tusks, and they sell the ivory for a lot of money in other countries.","zh":"犯罪分子為了象牙盜獵大象，並將象牙在其他國家以高價賣出。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A91","t":"盜獵"},{"w":"poacher","pos":"n.","def":"a person who hunts animals illegally","cn":"盜獵者","s":"The rangers caught a ________ in the national park last night, and they found three dead birds in his bag.","zh":"巡山員昨晚在國家公園裡抓到一名盜獵者，並在他的袋子裡發現了三隻死鳥。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A92","t":"盜獵者"},{"w":"poaching","pos":"n.","def":"the illegal hunting of animals","cn":"盜獵（行為）","s":"________ is the main reason why rhinos are in danger, because some people still believe their horns can cure illness.","zh":"盜獵是犀牛陷入危險的主要原因，因為有些人仍然相信犀牛角能治病。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A93","t":"盜獵"},{"w":"ivory","pos":"n.","def":"the hard white material from elephant tusks","cn":"象牙","s":"Many countries have stopped the sale of ________, but some people still buy it secretly as jewellery or art.","zh":"許多國家已經禁止販售象牙，但仍有一些人偷偷購買它作為珠寶或藝術品。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A94","t":"象牙"},{"w":"tusk","pos":"n.","def":"a very long pointed tooth of an elephant","cn":"（象等的）長牙","s":"An elephant uses its ________ to dig for water and remove tree bark, so losing them makes its life much harder.","zh":"大象用牠的長牙挖水和剝樹皮，所以失去長牙會讓牠的生活困難許多。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A95","t":"長牙"},{"w":"horn","pos":"n.","def":"a hard pointed part growing on an animal's head","cn":"角","s":"A rhino's ________ is made of the same material as our fingernails, but criminals still sell it at a very high price.","zh":"犀牛的角是由和我們指甲一樣的物質組成，但犯罪分子仍以極高的價格販售它。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A96","t":"角"},{"w":"rhino","pos":"n.","def":"a large heavy animal with one or two horns on its nose","cn":"犀牛","s":"Only a few northern white ________ are left in the world, so scientists are trying to save them with new technology.","zh":"全世界只剩下幾頭北方白犀牛，所以科學家們正嘗試用新科技拯救牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A97","t":"犀牛"},{"w":"pangolin","pos":"n.","def":"a small animal covered in hard scales that eats ants","cn":"穿山甲","s":"The ________ rolls into a ball when it is scared, but this does not protect it from poachers who simply pick it up.","zh":"穿山甲受到驚嚇時會捲成一顆球，但這無法保護牠免於盜獵者，因為他們直接就能把牠撿起來。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A98","t":"穿山甲"},{"w":"smuggle","pos":"v.","def":"to take things secretly and illegally into a country","cn":"走私","s":"The man tried to ________ rare turtles through the airport in his suitcase, but the security officers found them on the X-ray screen.","zh":"那名男子試圖把稀有的烏龜藏在行李箱裡走私通過機場，但安檢人員在X光螢幕上發現了牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A99","t":"走私"},{"w":"smuggler","pos":"n.","def":"a person who smuggles goods illegally","cn":"走私者","s":"The police arrested a ________ at the harbour, because he was hiding hundreds of parrots in small plastic tubes.","zh":"警方在港口逮捕了一名走私者，因為他把數百隻鸚鵡藏在小塑膠管裡。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A100","t":"走私者"},{"w":"trafficking","pos":"n.","def":"the illegal buying and selling of goods or animals","cn":"非法交易；販運","s":"Wildlife ________ is a huge business around the world, so governments must work together to stop it.","zh":"野生動物非法交易是全球性的大生意，所以各國政府必須合作阻止它。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A101","t":"非法交易"},{"w":"trafficker","pos":"n.","def":"a person who buys and sells illegal goods","cn":"非法販運者","s":"The ________ sold baby monkeys online as pets, but the police tracked him down after a buyer reported the website.","zh":"那名非法販運者在網路上把小猴子當寵物販售，但在一位買家檢舉該網站後，警方追查到了他。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A102","t":"非法販運者"},{"w":"illegal","pos":"adj.","def":"not allowed by law","cn":"非法的；違法的","s":"It is ________ to keep a Formosan black bear as a pet in Taiwan, and anyone who does so may face a heavy fine.","zh":"在台灣把台灣黑熊當寵物飼養是違法的，任何這麼做的人都可能面臨重罰。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A103","t":"違法的"},{"w":"confiscate","pos":"v.","def":"to officially take something away from someone","cn":"沒收","s":"Customs officers ________ two hundred kilograms of shark fins, and they plan to destroy them in public next month.","zh":"海關人員沒收了兩百公斤的魚翅，並計畫下個月公開銷毀。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A104","t":"沒收"},{"w":"seizure","pos":"n.","def":"the act of taking illegal goods by force or law","cn":"查獲；扣押","s":"The ________ of ten tonnes of pangolin scales was the largest ever in the country, and it shocked many animal lovers.","zh":"查獲十公噸穿山甲鱗片是該國有史以來最大規模的查獲，讓許多愛護動物的人士大為震驚。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A105","t":"查獲"},{"w":"customs","pos":"n.","def":"the place at a border where officers check goods","cn":"海關","s":"The traveller was stopped at ________ because his bag smelled strange, and the officers found live lizards inside.","zh":"那名旅客在海關被攔下，因為他的包包有股奇怪的味道，而官員在裡面發現了活的蜥蜴。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A106","t":"海關"},{"w":"ranger","pos":"n.","def":"a person whose job is to protect a park or forest","cn":"巡山員；保育巡查員","s":"The ________ walks through the forest every day to check the camera traps, and he also looks for signs of poachers.","zh":"那位巡山員每天走過森林檢查自動相機，同時也尋找盜獵者的蹤跡。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A107","t":"巡山員"},{"w":"patrol","pos":"v.","def":"to walk or drive around an area to protect it","cn":"巡邏","s":"Soldiers and rangers ________ the park at night, because most poachers come in the dark when they think no one is watching.","zh":"士兵和巡山員晚上會在公園裡巡邏，因為大多數盜獵者會在他們以為沒人注意的夜裡前來。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A108","t":"巡邏"},{"w":"trophy","pos":"n.","def":"part of a dead animal kept to show hunting success","cn":"（狩獵）戰利品","s":"Some rich tourists pay to shoot lions and take their heads home as a ________, but many people think this is cruel.","zh":"有些有錢的觀光客付錢射殺獅子，並把獅子頭帶回家當作戰利品，但許多人認為這很殘忍。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A109","t":"戰利品"},{"w":"fur","pos":"n.","def":"the thick soft hair of an animal","cn":"毛皮","s":"Many fashion brands no longer use real ________ in their coats, because customers do not want animals to suffer for clothes.","zh":"許多時尚品牌不再在大衣中使用真的毛皮，因為顧客不希望動物為了衣服而受苦。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A110","t":"毛皮"},{"w":"souvenir","pos":"n.","def":"something you buy to remember a trip","cn":"紀念品","s":"Never buy a ________ made from coral or turtle shell on holiday, because it may be illegal and it harms sea life.","zh":"度假時千萬不要購買用珊瑚或龜殼做的紀念品，因為那可能是違法的，而且會傷害海洋生物。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A111","t":"紀念品"},{"w":"exotic","pos":"adj.","def":"from a faraway country; unusual and interesting","cn":"外來的；奇特的","s":"Some people keep ________ pets like snakes and parrots, but many of these animals were caught illegally in the wild.","zh":"有些人飼養蛇和鸚鵡等奇特的寵物，但這些動物中有許多是從野外非法捕捉來的。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A112","t":"奇特的"},{"w":"crackdown","pos":"n.","def":"strong official action to stop illegal activity","cn":"嚴厲打擊；取締","s":"The government started a ________ on illegal pet shops, and dozens of rare birds were rescued in just one week.","zh":"政府展開了對非法寵物店的嚴厲取締，短短一週內就救出了數十隻稀有鳥類。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A113","t":"嚴厲取締"},{"w":"penalty","pos":"n.","def":"a punishment for breaking a law","cn":"處罰；刑罰","s":"The ________ for killing a protected animal in Taiwan is very serious, and the criminal may even go to prison.","zh":"在台灣殺害保育類動物的刑罰非常重，犯人甚至可能入獄。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A114","t":"刑罰"},{"w":"snare","pos":"n.","def":"a trap made of wire for catching animals","cn":"（捕獸的）套索；陷阱","s":"A young bear lost part of its paw in a ________, so the vet had to perform an operation to save its life.","zh":"一隻小熊的腳掌因捕獸套索失去了一部分，所以獸醫必須動手術救牠一命。","part":"A","sec":"Poaching & Illegal Wildlife Trade 盜獵與非法野生動物交易","lab":"A115","t":"捕獸套索"},{"w":"conserve","pos":"v.","def":"to protect something from being damaged or lost","cn":"保護；保存","s":"Local villagers work with scientists to ________ the forest, because it gives them clean water as well as a home for animals.","zh":"當地村民和科學家合作保護森林，因為森林不僅為動物提供家園，也為他們提供乾淨的水。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A116","t":"保護"},{"w":"conservationist","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works to protect nature","cn":"保育人士","s":"The ________ has spent twenty years saving sea turtles, and she teaches children how to keep the beaches clean.","zh":"那位保育人士花了二十年拯救海龜，她也教孩子們如何保持海灘乾淨。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A117","t":"保育人士"},{"w":"preservation","pos":"n.","def":"the act of keeping something safe from harm","cn":"保存；保護","s":"The ________ of old forests is important, because many animals cannot survive in young forests that have just been planted.","zh":"老森林的保護很重要，因為許多動物無法在剛種植的年輕森林中生存。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A118","t":"保護"},{"w":"protection","pos":"n.","def":"the act of keeping someone or something safe","cn":"保護","s":"The black-faced spoonbill is under legal ________ in Taiwan, so no one is allowed to hunt or disturb it.","zh":"黑面琵鷺在台灣受到法律保護，所以任何人都不得獵捕或干擾牠。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A119","t":"保護"},{"w":"sanctuary","pos":"n.","def":"a safe place where animals are protected","cn":"保護區；庇護所","s":"The elephants at the ________ were rescued from circuses, and now they can walk freely and swim in the river.","zh":"庇護所裡的大象是從馬戲團被救出來的，現在牠們可以自由行走並在河裡游泳。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A120","t":"庇護所"},{"w":"wilderness","pos":"n.","def":"a wild natural area where no people live","cn":"荒野","s":"Alaska still has huge areas of ________, so bears and wolves can live there without being disturbed by people.","zh":"阿拉斯加仍有大片的荒野，所以熊和狼可以生活在那裡而不受人類干擾。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A121","t":"荒野"},{"w":"reintroduce","pos":"v.","def":"to bring an animal back to an area where it once lived","cn":"重新引入；野放回原棲地","s":"Scientists plan to ________ beavers to the river, because they believe the animals can help create new wetlands.","zh":"科學家計畫把河狸重新引入那條河，因為他們相信這些動物能幫助創造新的濕地。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A122","t":"重新引入"},{"w":"reintroduction","pos":"n.","def":"the act of bringing a species back to its old habitat","cn":"重新引入","s":"The ________ of wolves to Yellowstone was a great success, and the whole ecosystem became healthier afterwards.","zh":"狼群重新引入黃石公園非常成功，之後整個生態系統都變得更健康了。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A123","t":"重新引入"},{"w":"restoration","pos":"n.","def":"the act of returning something to its earlier good condition","cn":"復育；修復","s":"The ________ of the old rice fields brought back many frogs and fireflies, so families now visit the area at night.","zh":"舊稻田的復育讓許多青蛙和螢火蟲回來了，所以現在家庭們都會在晚上造訪那個地區。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A124","t":"復育"},{"w":"rewilding","pos":"n.","def":"returning land to its natural wild state","cn":"野化；再野化","s":"________ projects in Europe allow farmland to turn back into forest, and wild animals like bison have started to return.","zh":"歐洲的再野化計畫讓農地恢復成森林，而像野牛這樣的野生動物已經開始回來了。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A125","t":"再野化"},{"w":"corridor","pos":"n.","def":"a strip of land that connects two habitats","cn":"（生態）廊道","s":"The government built a wildlife ________ under the highway, so leopard cats can cross safely from one forest to another.","zh":"政府在高速公路下方建造了一條野生動物廊道，讓石虎能安全地從一片森林穿越到另一片森林。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A126","t":"廊道"},{"w":"quota","pos":"n.","def":"a fixed limit on the number of something allowed","cn":"配額；限額","s":"Each fishing boat has a ________ for tuna, so it must stop fishing when it reaches that number.","zh":"每艘漁船都有鮪魚的捕撈配額，所以達到該數量時就必須停止捕撈。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A127","t":"配額"},{"w":"census","pos":"n.","def":"an official count of a population","cn":"普查；數量調查","s":"Volunteers joined the annual bird ________ last weekend, and they counted more spoonbills than ever before.","zh":"志工們上週末參加了年度鳥類普查，他們數到的黑面琵鷺比以往任何時候都多。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A128","t":"普查"},{"w":"tag","pos":"v.","def":"to put a small label or device on an animal","cn":"為……加上標籤","s":"Researchers ________ young sharks with small electronic devices, so they can follow where the sharks swim around the world.","zh":"研究人員為幼鯊加上小型電子標籤，這樣他們就能追蹤鯊魚在世界各地游到哪裡。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A129","t":"加上 標籤"},{"w":"collar","pos":"n.","def":"a band put around an animal's neck","cn":"項圈","s":"The bear wears a GPS ________ around its neck, and the scientists can see its location on their computer every hour.","zh":"那隻熊的脖子上戴著一個GPS項圈，科學家每小時都能在電腦上看到牠的位置。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A130","t":"項圈"},{"w":"volunteer","pos":"n.","def":"a person who works without being paid","cn":"志工；義工","s":"As a ________ at the animal rescue centre, I clean the cages every Saturday, and I also help feed the injured birds.","zh":"身為動物救援中心的志工，我每個星期六都會清洗籠子，也會幫忙餵食受傷的鳥。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A131","t":"志工"},{"w":"donation","pos":"n.","def":"money or goods given to help a group","cn":"捐款；捐贈","s":"Thanks to a large ________ from a local company, the zoo was able to build a bigger home for its tigers.","zh":"多虧一家本地公司的大筆捐款，動物園得以為老虎建造一個更大的家。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A132","t":"捐款"},{"w":"charity","pos":"n.","def":"an organisation that helps people or animals in need","cn":"慈善機構","s":"My class raised money for a wildlife ________, and the charity used it to buy medicine for injured turtles.","zh":"我們班為一家野生動物慈善機構募款，而該機構用這筆錢購買受傷海龜的藥品。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A133","t":"慈善機構"},{"w":"campaign","pos":"n.","def":"a planned series of actions to achieve a goal","cn":"運動；宣傳活動","s":"The students started a ________ to stop people from feeding wild monkeys, because human food makes the monkeys sick and aggressive.","zh":"學生們發起了一項宣傳活動，勸阻人們餵食野生猴子，因為人類的食物會讓猴子生病並變得具攻擊性。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A134","t":"宣傳活動"},{"w":"petition","pos":"n.","def":"a written request signed by many people","cn":"請願書；連署","s":"More than fifty thousand people signed a ________ to save the wetland, so the city council finally cancelled the building plan.","zh":"超過五萬人簽署了拯救濕地的連署，所以市議會最終取消了建設計畫。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A135","t":"連署"},{"w":"ecotourism","pos":"n.","def":"travel to natural areas that helps protect them","cn":"生態旅遊","s":"________ brings money to local villages, so people there now see living whales as more valuable than dead ones.","zh":"生態旅遊為當地村莊帶來收入，所以那裡的人們現在認為活的鯨魚比死的更有價值。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A136","t":"生態旅遊"},{"w":"eco-friendly","pos":"adj.","def":"not harmful to the environment","cn":"環保的；對環境友善的","s":"Our hotel uses ________ soap and shampoo, because the water from the rooms flows into a river full of fish.","zh":"我們的飯店使用環保香皂和洗髮精，因為房間的排水會流入一條充滿魚的河流。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A137","t":"環保"},{"w":"recovery","pos":"n.","def":"the process of returning to a healthy state","cn":"恢復；復原","s":"The humpback whale has made a strong ________ since hunting was stopped, and now tourists can see them near Taiwan again.","zh":"自從捕鯨被禁止後，大翅鯨的數量已大幅恢復，現在遊客又能在台灣附近看到牠們了。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A138","t":"恢復"},{"w":"rebound","pos":"v.","def":"to increase again after falling","cn":"回升；反彈","s":"The number of sea otters began to ________ after hunting was banned, and today hundreds swim along the Californian coast.","zh":"禁止獵捕後海獺的數量開始回升，如今已有數百隻在加州海岸游泳。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A139","t":"回升"},{"w":"thrive","pos":"v.","def":"to grow strongly and successfully","cn":"茁壯成長；興盛","s":"Fireflies ________ in clean, dark places, so they disappear quickly when bright lights and dirty water arrive.","zh":"螢火蟲在乾淨又黑暗的地方茁壯繁衍，所以當明亮的燈光和髒水出現時，牠們很快就會消失。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A140","t":"茁壯繁衍"},{"w":"flourish","pos":"v.","def":"to grow well and be healthy","cn":"繁盛；蓬勃發展","s":"After the factory closed, the river became clean again, and fish and water birds began to ________ there.","zh":"工廠關閉後，河水又變乾淨了，魚和水鳥開始在那裡繁盛起來。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A141","t":"繁盛"},{"w":"treaty","pos":"n.","def":"a formal written agreement between countries","cn":"條約","s":"More than 180 countries have signed a ________ that controls the trade in wild animals, but some still fail to follow it.","zh":"超過一百八十個國家簽署了一項管制野生動物貿易的條約，但有些國家仍未遵守。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A142","t":"條約"},{"w":"cull","pos":"v.","def":"to kill some animals to reduce their number","cn":"撲殺；選擇性宰殺","s":"The island decided to ________ the wild goats, because they were eating all the plants that rare birds needed.","zh":"那座島決定撲殺野山羊，因為牠們把稀有鳥類需要的植物都吃光了。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A143","t":"撲殺"},{"w":"relocate","pos":"v.","def":"to move animals to a new place","cn":"遷移；移置","s":"The team had to ________ the turtle eggs to a safer beach, because the old beach was going to flood during the typhoon.","zh":"團隊必須把海龜蛋移置到較安全的海灘，因為原本的海灘在颱風期間將會淹水。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A144","t":"移置"},{"w":"buffer","pos":"n.","def":"an area that protects something from harm","cn":"緩衝區","s":"Farmers left a ________ of trees between their fields and the river, and it stops chemicals from flowing into the water.","zh":"農夫們在農田和河流之間留下一片樹木作為緩衝區，它能阻止化學物質流入水中。","part":"A","sec":"Conservation Action & Protected Areas 保育行動與保護區","lab":"A145","t":"緩衝區"},{"w":"breed / bred / bred","pos":"v.","def":"to keep animals so that they produce babies","cn":"繁殖；培育","s":"The zoo has ________ several baby pandas over the years, and some of them were later sent back to China.","zh":"動物園多年來已經繁殖了好幾隻貓熊寶寶，其中有些後來被送回中國。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A146","t":"繁殖"},{"w":"breeding","pos":"n.","def":"the process of animals producing young","cn":"繁殖；育種","s":"The ________ season for sea turtles starts in May, so the beaches are closed to visitors at night.","zh":"海龜的繁殖季從五月開始，所以海灘晚上不開放遊客進入。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A147","t":"繁殖"},{"w":"captive","pos":"adj.","def":"kept in a cage or enclosed area; not free","cn":"圈養的；被捕獲的","s":"The ________ kakapos are watched closely by scientists, and each egg is carefully protected until it hatches.","zh":"圈養的鴞鸚鵡受到科學家密切觀察，每一顆蛋都受到細心保護直到孵化。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A148","t":"圈養的"},{"w":"captivity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being kept in a cage or zoo","cn":"圈養；囚禁","s":"Dolphins in ________ often show signs of boredom, because a small pool is very different from the open ocean.","zh":"圈養中的海豚常常出現無聊的跡象，因為小水池和廣闊的海洋非常不同。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A149","t":"圈養"},{"w":"offspring","pos":"n.","def":"the baby or babies of an animal","cn":"後代；幼崽","s":"An elephant usually has only one ________ every four or five years, so it takes a long time for their numbers to grow.","zh":"大象通常每四到五年才生一隻後代，所以牠們的數量需要很長時間才能增加。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A150","t":"後代"},{"w":"mate","pos":"v.","def":"to come together to produce babies","cn":"交配","s":"Male peacocks show their beautiful tails to attract females, and the females choose the best male to ________ with.","zh":"雄孔雀展示牠們美麗的尾羽來吸引雌孔雀，而雌孔雀會選擇最好的雄孔雀來交配。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A151","t":"交配"},{"w":"hatch","pos":"v.","def":"to break out of an egg","cn":"孵化","s":"The baby turtles ________ at night when the sand is cool, and then they follow the moonlight to the sea.","zh":"小海龜在沙子涼爽的夜晚孵化，然後牠們跟著月光爬向大海。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A152","t":"孵化"},{"w":"hatchling","pos":"n.","def":"a baby animal that has just come out of its egg","cn":"剛孵化的幼體","s":"Only one ________ out of a thousand turtles grows into an adult, because birds and fish eat most of them.","zh":"一千隻剛孵化的小海龜中只有一隻能長大為成龜，因為大部分都被鳥和魚吃掉了。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A153","t":"剛孵化的小海龜"},{"w":"cub","pos":"n.","def":"a young bear, lion, tiger or fox","cn":"幼獸（熊、獅、虎等）","s":"The bear ________ stays with its mother for about two years, and it learns how to find food and climb trees.","zh":"小熊會和媽媽待在一起大約兩年，學習如何找食物和爬樹。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A154","t":"熊"},{"w":"calf","pos":"n.","def":"a young cow, elephant or whale","cn":"幼崽（牛、象、鯨等）","s":"The baby elephant is called a ________, and the whole herd protects it when lions come close.","zh":"小象被稱為幼象，當獅子靠近時，整個象群都會保護牠。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A155","t":"幼象"},{"w":"litter","pos":"n.","def":"a group of baby animals born at the same time","cn":"一窩（幼崽）","s":"Our neighbour's cat gave birth to a ________ of five kittens, so she is looking for kind families to adopt them.","zh":"鄰居的貓生了一窩五隻小貓，所以她正在尋找有愛心的家庭來領養牠們。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A156","t":"一窩"},{"w":"lay / laid / laid","pos":"v.","def":"to produce an egg from the body","cn":"產（卵）；下（蛋）","s":"The mother turtle ________ about one hundred eggs in the sand, and then she slowly crawled back to the sea.","zh":"海龜媽媽在沙裡產下大約一百顆蛋，然後慢慢地爬回大海。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A157","t":"產下"},{"w":"incubate","pos":"v.","def":"to keep eggs warm until they hatch","cn":"孵（蛋）","s":"Because the parents had left the nest, the rescue centre had to ________ the eggs in a warm machine.","zh":"因為鳥爸媽離開了鳥巢，救援中心只好用保溫機器來孵這些蛋。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A158","t":"孵"},{"w":"forage","pos":"v.","def":"to search for food","cn":"覓食","s":"Wild boars ________ in the forest at night, but sometimes they come into villages and dig up farmers' sweet potatoes.","zh":"山豬在夜晚於森林中覓食，但有時牠們會跑進村莊挖農夫的地瓜。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A159","t":"覓食"},{"w":"graze","pos":"v.","def":"to eat grass in a field","cn":"吃草；放牧","s":"The deer ________ quietly in the field every evening, but they run away as soon as they smell a human.","zh":"鹿每天傍晚都在田野裡安靜地吃草，但一聞到人類的氣味就會立刻逃跑。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A160","t":"吃草"},{"w":"camouflage","pos":"n.","def":"colours or patterns that help an animal hide","cn":"偽裝；保護色","s":"The leaf insect has perfect ________, so birds fly right past it without noticing it on the branch.","zh":"葉䗛有完美的偽裝，所以鳥從牠旁邊飛過也不會注意到樹枝上的牠。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A161","t":"偽裝"},{"w":"instinct","pos":"n.","def":"a natural behaviour an animal does without learning","cn":"本能","s":"Baby turtles move towards the sea by ________, even though no one has ever shown them the way.","zh":"小海龜靠著本能朝大海前進，即使從來沒有人教過牠們怎麼走。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A162","t":"本能"},{"w":"flock","pos":"n.","def":"a group of birds or sheep","cn":"（鳥或羊的）群","s":"A ________ of spoonbills landed in the wetland at sunset, and the birdwatchers quickly lifted their cameras.","zh":"一群黑面琵鷺在日落時降落在濕地上，賞鳥人士迅速舉起了相機。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A163","t":"群"},{"w":"herd","pos":"n.","def":"a large group of animals such as cows or elephants","cn":"（動物的）群","s":"A ________ of buffalo crossed the road slowly, so all the cars had to stop and wait for several minutes.","zh":"一群水牛緩緩地穿越馬路，所以所有車輛都必須停下來等好幾分鐘。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A164","t":"群"},{"w":"solitary","pos":"adj.","def":"living or spending time alone","cn":"獨居的","s":"Leopards are ________ animals that hunt alone, while lions live and hunt together in big family groups.","zh":"豹是單獨狩獵的獨居動物，而獅子則以大家庭群體一起生活和狩獵。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A165","t":"獨居"},{"w":"rescue","pos":"v.","def":"to save someone or something from danger","cn":"救援；拯救","s":"Fishermen ________ a baby dolphin that was trapped in a net, and they carefully returned it to the sea.","zh":"漁民們救出了一隻被困在網中的小海豚，並小心地把牠送回海裡。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A166","t":"救"},{"w":"rehabilitate","pos":"v.","def":"to help an injured animal become healthy again","cn":"使康復；使復原","s":"The centre ________ injured eagles for several months, and then it releases them back into the mountains.","zh":"中心會花好幾個月幫助受傷的老鷹康復，然後把牠們野放回山林。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A167","t":"幫助 康復"},{"w":"rehabilitation","pos":"n.","def":"the process of helping an animal recover","cn":"復健；康復治療","s":"After three months of ________, the sea turtle could swim well again, so the vets returned it to the ocean.","zh":"經過三個月的復健，那隻海龜又能好好游泳了，所以獸醫們把牠放回海洋。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A168","t":"復健"},{"w":"veterinarian","pos":"n.","def":"an animal doctor","cn":"獸醫","s":"The ________ removed a fishing hook from the bird's throat, and the bird was able to eat again the next day.","zh":"獸醫從那隻鳥的喉嚨裡取出了一個魚鉤，隔天那隻鳥就能再次進食了。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A169","t":"獸醫"},{"w":"orphaned","pos":"adj.","def":"having lost its parents","cn":"失去父母的；成為孤兒的","s":"The ________ baby monkey was found alone by the road, so volunteers fed it milk every three hours.","zh":"那隻失去父母的小猴子被發現獨自待在路邊，所以志工們每三個小時就餵牠喝一次奶。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A170","t":"失去父母的"},{"w":"injured","pos":"adj.","def":"hurt or harmed","cn":"受傷的","s":"We found an ________ owl in the school garden, and we called the animal rescue centre right away.","zh":"我們在學校的花園裡發現了一隻受傷的貓頭鷹，於是馬上打電話給動物救援中心。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A171","t":"受傷的"},{"w":"zookeeper","pos":"n.","def":"a person who looks after animals in a zoo","cn":"動物園管理員；保育員","s":"The ________ prepares fresh bamboo for the pandas every morning, and she also checks whether they are healthy.","zh":"那位保育員每天早上都為貓熊準備新鮮的竹子，也會檢查牠們是否健康。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A172","t":"保育員"},{"w":"enclosure","pos":"n.","def":"an area with a fence or wall where animals are kept","cn":"圍欄；圈養區","s":"The new ________ for the tigers has trees, rocks and a pool, so the animals can behave more naturally.","zh":"老虎的新圈養區有樹木、岩石和水池，所以動物們能表現得更自然。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A173","t":"圈養區"},{"w":"aquarium","pos":"n.","def":"a building where people can see fish and sea animals","cn":"水族館","s":"We visited the ________ in Pingtung last summer, and the children loved watching the penguins and sharks.","zh":"我們去年夏天參觀了屏東的水族館，孩子們很喜歡看企鵝和鯊魚。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A174","t":"水族館"},{"w":"zoo","pos":"n.","def":"a place where wild animals are kept for people to see","cn":"動物園","s":"The Taipei ________ is very popular with families, and it also runs programmes to protect the Formosan pangolin.","zh":"台北市立動物園很受家庭歡迎，而且它也推行保護台灣穿山甲的計畫。","part":"A","sec":"Animal Behaviour, Breeding & Rescue 動物行為、繁殖與救援","lab":"A175","t":"動物園"},{"w":"livestock","pos":"n.","def":"farm animals such as cows, sheep and goats","cn":"家畜；牲畜","s":"Wolves sometimes attack farmers' ________ at night, so many farmers now use guard dogs to protect their sheep.","zh":"狼有時會在夜裡攻擊農夫的家畜，所以許多農夫現在用護衛犬來保護他們的羊。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A176","t":"家畜"},{"w":"cattle","pos":"n.","def":"cows and bulls kept on a farm","cn":"牛（總稱）","s":"The farmer lost three ________ to a lion last month, so he is now building a stronger fence around his farm.","zh":"那位農夫上個月有三頭牛被獅子咬死，所以他現在正在農場周圍建造更堅固的圍籬。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A177","t":"牛"},{"w":"herder","pos":"n.","def":"a person who looks after a group of animals","cn":"牧民；牧人","s":"The ________ walks with his goats through the mountains every day, and he carries a whistle to scare away wild animals.","zh":"那位牧民每天帶著他的山羊走過山區，並帶著一個哨子來嚇跑野生動物。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A178","t":"牧民"},{"w":"rancher","pos":"n.","def":"a person who owns or runs a large cattle farm","cn":"牧場主人","s":"The ________ was angry when wolves returned to the area, but later he learned to protect his cows without killing them.","zh":"當狼回到這個地區時，那位牧場主人很生氣，但後來他學會了在不殺狼的情況下保護他的牛。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A179","t":"牧場主人"},{"w":"farmland","pos":"n.","def":"land used for growing crops or keeping animals","cn":"農地；農田","s":"Much of the forest was turned into ________ fifty years ago, so the leopard cats now live close to people.","zh":"五十年前大部分的森林被改成了農地，所以石虎現在住得離人很近。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A180","t":"農地"},{"w":"crop","pos":"n.","def":"a plant grown on a farm for food","cn":"農作物","s":"Elephants sometimes eat a whole field of ________ in one night, so the farmers lose all the food they planned to sell.","zh":"大象有時一個晚上就吃掉整片田的農作物，讓農夫們失去所有打算拿去賣的作物。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A181","t":"農作物"},{"w":"fence","pos":"n.","def":"a wall made of wood or wire around a field","cn":"圍籬；柵欄","s":"The villagers built an electric ________ around their fields, but the clever elephants learned to push trees onto it.","zh":"村民們在田地周圍建造了電圍籬，但聰明的大象學會了把樹推倒在上面。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A182","t":"圍籬"},{"w":"shepherd","pos":"n.","def":"a person who looks after sheep","cn":"牧羊人","s":"The ________ keeps his sheep inside a strong pen at night, because snow leopards often hunt in the area.","zh":"那位牧羊人晚上把羊關在堅固的羊圈裡，因為雪豹常在那一帶獵食。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A183","t":"牧羊人"},{"w":"raid","pos":"v.","def":"to attack a place suddenly to take things","cn":"襲擊；搶奪","s":"Monkeys often ________ the fruit farms in the mountains, and they can eat hundreds of bananas in a single afternoon.","zh":"猴子常常襲擊山上的果園，牠們一個下午就能吃掉數百根香蕉。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A184","t":"襲擊"},{"w":"retaliate","pos":"v.","def":"to hurt someone because they hurt you","cn":"報復","s":"When a tiger killed their cows, some villagers wanted to ________, but the rangers convinced them to wait for help.","zh":"當老虎咬死他們的牛時，有些村民想要報復，但巡山員說服他們等待協助。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A185","t":"報復"},{"w":"retaliation","pos":"n.","def":"action taken to hurt someone who hurt you","cn":"報復（行為）","s":"Many lions are killed in ________ for attacks on cattle, so conservation groups pay farmers when they lose animals.","zh":"許多獅子因為攻擊牛隻而遭到報復殺害，所以保育團體會在農民損失牲畜時給予賠償。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A186","t":"報復"},{"w":"compensation","pos":"n.","def":"money paid to someone for a loss","cn":"補償；賠償金","s":"The government gives ________ to farmers whose chickens are killed by leopard cats, so the farmers are less likely to hurt them.","zh":"政府會給雞隻被石虎咬死的農民賠償金，所以農民比較不會傷害石虎。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A187","t":"賠償金"},{"w":"coexist","pos":"v.","def":"to live together peacefully in the same place","cn":"共存","s":"People and bears can ________ in the same mountains, but campers must keep their food in locked boxes.","zh":"人類和熊可以在同一片山林中共存，但露營者必須把食物放在上鎖的箱子裡。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A188","t":"共存"},{"w":"coexistence","pos":"n.","def":"the state of living together peacefully","cn":"共存","s":"Peaceful ________ between farmers and elephants is possible, but it needs good planning and support from the government.","zh":"農民與大象之間的和平共存是可能的，但這需要良好的規劃和政府的支持。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A189","t":"共存"},{"w":"deter","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something from happening by making it difficult","cn":"嚇阻；阻止","s":"Farmers hang bright lights around their farms to ________ lions at night, and the number of attacks has dropped a lot.","zh":"農民在農場周圍掛上明亮的燈來在夜間嚇阻獅子，攻擊事件的數量因此大幅減少。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A190","t":"嚇阻"},{"w":"deterrent","pos":"n.","def":"something that makes people or animals not want to do something","cn":"嚇阻物；威懾","s":"Beehives along the fence are a good ________ against elephants, because the large animals are afraid of bee stings.","zh":"沿著圍籬設置的蜂箱是防範大象的好嚇阻物，因為這些大型動物害怕被蜜蜂叮咬。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A191","t":"嚇阻物"},{"w":"trap","pos":"n.","def":"a device for catching animals","cn":"陷阱；捕獸器","s":"The researchers used a safe ________ to catch the leopard cat, and they released it after putting on a GPS collar.","zh":"研究人員用安全的捕獸器捕捉石虎，並在為牠戴上GPS項圈後將牠野放。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A192","t":"捕獸器"},{"w":"pest","pos":"n.","def":"an insect or animal that damages crops or food","cn":"害蟲；有害動物","s":"Some farmers see wild boars as a ________, because the boars destroy their vegetable gardens almost every night.","zh":"有些農民把山豬視為有害動物，因為山豬幾乎每晚都破壞他們的菜園。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A193","t":"有害動物"},{"w":"landowner","pos":"n.","def":"a person who owns land","cn":"地主","s":"The ________ agreed to keep part of his forest untouched, so the rare birds living there would not lose their home.","zh":"那位地主同意保留他一部分的森林不被開發，讓住在那裡的稀有鳥類不會失去家園。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A194","t":"地主"},{"w":"villager","pos":"n.","def":"a person who lives in a village","cn":"村民","s":"Every ________ was invited to the meeting about the new nature park, because the plan would change their daily lives.","zh":"每一位村民都受邀參加有關新自然公園的會議，因為這項計畫將會改變他們的日常生活。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A195","t":"村民"},{"w":"harvest","pos":"n.","def":"the time when crops are collected","cn":"收成；收穫","s":"Just before the ________, a group of monkeys came down from the mountain and ate most of the farmer's peaches.","zh":"就在收成前，一群猴子從山上下來，吃掉了農夫大部分的桃子。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A196","t":"收成"},{"w":"livelihood","pos":"n.","def":"the way someone earns money to live","cn":"生計","s":"Fishing is the main ________ of the islanders, so they need to protect the sea if they want to keep their jobs.","zh":"捕魚是島民主要的生計，所以如果他們想保住工作，就必須保護海洋。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A197","t":"生計"},{"w":"poultry","pos":"n.","def":"chickens, ducks and other farm birds","cn":"家禽","s":"Leopard cats sometimes steal ________ from farms, but some farmers now use stronger cages to keep their chickens safe.","zh":"石虎有時會偷農場的家禽，但有些農民現在用更堅固的籠子來保護他們的雞。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A198","t":"家禽"},{"w":"hostile","pos":"adj.","def":"unfriendly and ready to fight","cn":"敵對的；不友善的","s":"Local people used to be ________ towards the wolves, but their attitude changed when wolf tourism brought money to the town.","zh":"當地人過去對狼抱持敵對的態度，但當賞狼旅遊為小鎮帶來收入後，他們的態度就改變了。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A199","t":"敵對的"},{"w":"tolerate","pos":"v.","def":"to accept something you do not like","cn":"容忍；忍受","s":"Farmers are more willing to ________ wild animals on their land when they receive help to protect their crops.","zh":"當農民獲得保護農作物的協助時，他們更願意容忍野生動物出現在自己的土地上。","part":"A","sec":"People, Farming & Wildlife Conflict 人類、畜牧與野生動物衝突","lab":"A200","t":"容忍"},{"w":"abandon","pos":"v.","def":"to leave something or someone and not come back","cn":"拋棄；放棄","s":"Some owners ________ their pet turtles in city ponds when they get bored, but these turtles can harm the local wildlife.","zh":"有些飼主玩膩了就把寵物烏龜棄養在城市池塘裡，但這些烏龜會危害當地的野生動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B1","t":"棄養"},{"w":"accompany","pos":"v.","def":"to go somewhere with someone","cn":"陪同；伴隨","s":"A trained guide will ________ every group into the forest, because visitors might get lost or disturb the nesting birds.","zh":"每一團進入森林時都會有一位受過訓練的嚮導陪同，因為遊客可能會迷路或打擾築巢的鳥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B2","t":"陪同"},{"w":"adjacent","pos":"adj.","def":"next to or near something","cn":"鄰近的；毗連的","s":"The new factory will be built on land ________ to the wetland, so many birdwatchers are worried about noise and dirty water.","zh":"新工廠將蓋在鄰近濕地的土地上，所以許多賞鳥人士擔心噪音和汙水的問題。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B3","t":"鄰近"},{"w":"advocate","pos":"v.","def":"to publicly support an idea or plan","cn":"提倡；擁護","s":"Many scientists ________ stronger laws against the pet trade, because they have seen how many animals die during transport.","zh":"許多科學家提倡更嚴格的法律來對抗寵物交易，因為他們親眼看到許多動物在運送途中死亡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B4","t":"提倡"},{"w":"amend","pos":"v.","def":"to make small changes to a law or document","cn":"修訂；修正","s":"The government decided to ________ the wildlife law last year, so the penalties for selling protected animals are now much heavier.","zh":"政府去年決定修訂野生動物保育法，所以現在販售保育類動物的刑罰重了許多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B5","t":"修訂"},{"w":"annual","pos":"adj.","def":"happening once every year","cn":"每年的；年度的","s":"The ________ bird festival in Kenting attracts thousands of visitors, and local hotels are usually fully booked that week.","zh":"墾丁一年一度的賞鳥節吸引了數千名遊客，當地的飯店那一週通常都會客滿。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B6","t":"一年一度的"},{"w":"arbitrary","pos":"adj.","def":"chosen by chance, not based on reason","cn":"任意的；武斷的","s":"The borders of the national park are not ________, because scientists drew them after studying where the animals actually live.","zh":"國家公園的邊界並不是任意劃定的，因為科學家們是在研究動物實際棲息的地點之後才畫出來的。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B7","t":"任意"},{"w":"assemble","pos":"v.","def":"to gather together in one place","cn":"集合；聚集","s":"Thousands of crabs ________ on the beach every summer to release their eggs, and the road is closed so cars do not crush them.","zh":"每年夏天成千上萬隻螃蟹會聚集在海灘上釋放卵，道路會因此封閉以免車子壓死牠們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B8","t":"聚集"},{"w":"assess","pos":"v.","def":"to judge how good, bad or serious something is","cn":"評估","s":"Experts came to ________ the damage after the oil spill, and they found that hundreds of seabirds had been affected.","zh":"專家們在漏油事件後前來評估損害，他們發現有數百隻海鳥受到影響。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B9","t":"評估"},{"w":"assign","pos":"v.","def":"to give someone a job or task","cn":"分配；指派","s":"The leader will ________ each volunteer to a different beach, so the whole coastline can be checked for turtle nests.","zh":"領隊會把每位志工分派到不同的海灘，這樣整條海岸線都能被檢查是否有海龜巢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B10","t":"分派"},{"w":"attain","pos":"v.","def":"to reach a goal after a lot of effort","cn":"達到；獲得","s":"The project hopes to ________ its goal of five hundred kakapos by 2030, but it will need more money and more islands.","zh":"該計畫希望在2030年前達到五百隻鴞鸚鵡的目標，但這需要更多資金和更多島嶼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B11","t":"達到"},{"w":"bulk","pos":"n.","def":"the main or largest part of something","cn":"大部分；主體","s":"The ________ of the money goes to paying rangers, because protecting the animals on the ground is the most important job.","zh":"大部分的經費都用來支付巡山員的薪水，因為在第一線保護動物是最重要的工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B12","t":"部分"},{"w":"capable","pos":"adj.","def":"having the ability to do something","cn":"有能力的；能夠的","s":"Crows are ________ of using tools to find food, so scientists believe they are one of the smartest birds in the world.","zh":"烏鴉能夠使用工具尋找食物，所以科學家們認為牠們是世界上最聰明的鳥類之一。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B13","t":"能夠"},{"w":"cease","pos":"v.","def":"to stop doing something","cn":"停止","s":"The factory was ordered to ________ all work near the river, because its waste water was killing the fish.","zh":"那家工廠被下令停止在河邊的所有作業，因為它的廢水正在殺死魚群。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B14","t":"停止"},{"w":"cite","pos":"v.","def":"to mention something as proof or an example","cn":"引用；舉出","s":"In her report, the student ________ a study about bees, and she used it to show why pesticides should be controlled.","zh":"那位學生在報告中引用了一篇關於蜜蜂的研究，並用它來說明為何應該管制農藥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B15","t":"引用"},{"w":"coherent","pos":"adj.","def":"clear, logical and easy to understand","cn":"條理清晰的；連貫的","s":"The country needs a ________ plan to protect its forests, because different offices are currently making different rules.","zh":"這個國家需要一套條理清楚的計畫來保護森林，因為目前不同單位制定了不同的規則。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B16","t":"條理清楚的"},{"w":"coincide","pos":"v.","def":"to happen at the same time as something else","cn":"同時發生；巧合","s":"The rainy season ________ with the birth of many baby animals, so there is plenty of fresh food for the young ones.","zh":"雨季和許多小動物出生的時間同時發生，所以幼小的動物有充足的新鮮食物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B17","t":"同時發生"},{"w":"collapse","pos":"n.","def":"a sudden failure or fall","cn":"崩潰；瓦解","s":"Scientists warned that the ________ of the fish population could happen quickly, so the fishing season was shortened.","zh":"科學家警告魚群數量的崩潰可能來得很快，所以漁季被縮短了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B18","t":"崩潰"},{"w":"commence","pos":"v.","def":"to begin","cn":"開始","s":"The turtle-watching tours will ________ in June, but visitors must book early because only twenty people can join each night.","zh":"賞海龜行程將於六月開始，但遊客必須提早預約，因為每晚只能有二十人參加。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B19","t":"開始"},{"w":"commission","pos":"n.","def":"an official group given a special task","cn":"委員會","s":"A special ________ was set up to study the falling number of whales, and it will report its findings next year.","zh":"一個特別委員會已經成立，專門研究鯨魚數量下降的問題，並將在明年公布調查結果。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B20","t":"委員會"},{"w":"commit","pos":"v.","def":"to promise to give time or money to something","cn":"承諾；投入","s":"The company has ________ one million dollars to save the coral reefs, and its staff will also help clean the beaches.","zh":"那家公司已承諾投入一百萬美元拯救珊瑚礁，員工們也會協助清理海灘。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B21","t":"承諾投入"},{"w":"commodity","pos":"n.","def":"a product that can be bought and sold","cn":"商品；貨物","s":"For some criminals, wild animals are just a ________ to sell, and they do not care if the animals suffer.","zh":"對某些罪犯來說，野生動物只是可以販賣的商品，他們並不在乎動物是否受苦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B22","t":"商品"},{"w":"compatible","pos":"adj.","def":"able to exist together without problems","cn":"相容的；可共存的","s":"Tourism and wildlife protection can be ________, but only if the number of visitors is carefully controlled.","zh":"觀光和野生動物保護可以是相容的，但前提是遊客數量必須受到謹慎控管。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B23","t":"相容的"},{"w":"compile","pos":"v.","def":"to collect information and put it together","cn":"彙編；收集整理","s":"The volunteers ________ a list of every bird they saw this year, and the list will help scientists study changes in the area.","zh":"志工們彙整了今年看到的每一種鳥的清單，這份清單將幫助科學家研究這個地區的變化。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B24","t":"彙整"},{"w":"complement","pos":"v.","def":"to add something that makes another thing better","cn":"補充；與……相輔相成","s":"Online classes ________ the field trips well, because students first learn the facts and then see the animals in real life.","zh":"線上課程和戶外教學相輔相成，因為學生先學習知識，然後再親眼看到動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B25","t":"相輔相成"},{"w":"comprise","pos":"v.","def":"to consist of or be made up of","cn":"包含；由……組成","s":"The national park ________ forests, rivers and high mountains, so it is home to many different kinds of animals.","zh":"這座國家公園包含森林、河流和高山，所以它是許多不同種類動物的家園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B26","t":"包含"},{"w":"conceive","pos":"v.","def":"to think of a new idea or plan","cn":"構想出；想出","s":"The idea of the wildlife bridge was ________ by a group of students, and the city later decided to build it.","zh":"野生動物天橋的點子是由一群學生構想出來的，市政府後來決定建造它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B27","t":"構想出來的"},{"w":"conduct","pos":"v.","def":"to organise and carry out an activity","cn":"進行；實施","s":"The university will ________ a study on the frogs in the area, because their numbers have fallen in recent years.","zh":"大學將針對這個地區的青蛙進行一項研究，因為牠們的數量近年來下降了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B28","t":"進行"},{"w":"confine","pos":"v.","def":"to keep someone or something within a small area","cn":"限制；侷限","s":"The circus used to ________ the tigers to small cages, but now the animals live in a large sanctuary.","zh":"馬戲團過去把老虎關在小籠子裡，但現在這些動物住在一個大型庇護所中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B29","t":"關"},{"w":"conform","pos":"v.","def":"to follow rules or standards","cn":"遵守；符合","s":"All new buildings near the coast must ________ to the new rules, so they cannot use bright lights that confuse baby turtles.","zh":"海岸附近所有的新建築都必須符合新規定，所以不能使用會讓小海龜迷失方向的強光。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B30","t":"符合"},{"w":"constitute","pos":"v.","def":"to form or make up something","cn":"構成；組成","s":"Insects ________ more than half of all known animal species, but most people rarely think about protecting them.","zh":"昆蟲構成了所有已知動物物種的一半以上，但大多數人很少想到要保護牠們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B31","t":"構成"},{"w":"construct","pos":"v.","def":"to build something","cn":"建造；建構","s":"Engineers ________ a fish ladder beside the dam, so salmon can swim up the river to lay their eggs.","zh":"工程師們在水壩旁建造了一座魚梯，讓鮭魚能逆流而上去產卵。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B32","t":"建造"},{"w":"consult","pos":"v.","def":"to ask an expert for advice or information","cn":"諮詢；請教","s":"The city should ________ wildlife experts before building the new road, because it will cross an important forest.","zh":"市政府在建造新道路之前應該諮詢野生動物專家，因為這條路將穿越一片重要的森林。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B33","t":"諮詢"},{"w":"contemporary","pos":"adj.","def":"belonging to the present time; modern","cn":"當代的；現代的","s":"________ zoos focus more on education and protection, while old zoos were mainly places for entertainment.","zh":"當代的動物園更重視教育和保護，而舊式動物園主要是娛樂場所。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B34","t":"當代的"},{"w":"contrary","pos":"adj.","def":"completely different or opposite","cn":"相反的","s":"________ to popular belief, sharks rarely attack humans, and many more sharks are killed by people every year.","zh":"和一般人的看法相反，鯊魚很少攻擊人類，而每年被人類殺死的鯊魚卻多得多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B35","t":"相反"},{"w":"controversy","pos":"n.","def":"a lot of public disagreement about something","cn":"爭議","s":"The plan to kill wild cats on the island caused great ________, because some people believed there were kinder solutions.","zh":"撲殺島上野貓的計畫引起了極大的爭議，因為有些人認為還有更人道的解決方法。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B36","t":"爭議"},{"w":"convert","pos":"v.","def":"to change something into a different form or use","cn":"轉換；改變用途","s":"The town ________ an old fish farm into a nature park, and now hundreds of birds stop there in winter.","zh":"小鎮把一座舊養殖場改建成自然公園，現在每年冬天都有數百隻鳥在那裡停留。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B37","t":"改建成"},{"w":"convince","pos":"v.","def":"to make someone believe or do something","cn":"說服；使相信","s":"The documentary ________ many viewers to stop eating shark fin soup, because it showed how cruel the fishing was.","zh":"那部紀錄片說服了許多觀眾不再吃魚翅湯，因為它呈現了捕撈過程有多殘忍。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B38","t":"說服"},{"w":"coordinate","pos":"v.","def":"to organise people to work together well","cn":"協調","s":"The centre ________ the work of rangers, vets and volunteers, so every injured animal gets help as quickly as possible.","zh":"中心負責協調巡山員、獸醫和志工的工作，讓每隻受傷的動物都能盡快獲得協助。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B39","t":"協調"},{"w":"core","pos":"n.","def":"the most central or important part","cn":"核心；中心部分","s":"No visitors are allowed in the ________ of the reserve, because the rarest birds build their nests there.","zh":"保護區的核心區域禁止遊客進入，因為最稀有的鳥類在那裡築巢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B40","t":"核心"},{"w":"corporate","pos":"adj.","def":"related to large companies","cn":"企業的；公司的","s":"More ________ sponsors are supporting wildlife projects, because customers prefer brands that care about nature.","zh":"越來越多企業贊助商支持野生動物計畫，因為消費者偏好關心大自然的品牌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B41","t":"企業"},{"w":"correspond","pos":"v.","def":"to match or be similar to something","cn":"符合；相對應","s":"The drop in bird numbers ________ closely with the increase in pesticide use, so scientists believe the two are connected.","zh":"鳥類數量的下降和農藥使用量的增加密切對應，所以科學家認為兩者有關聯。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B42","t":"對應"},{"w":"criteria","pos":"n.","def":"standards used to judge something","cn":"標準；準則（複數）","s":"A species must meet certain ________ before it is called endangered, such as a fast drop in its population.","zh":"一個物種必須符合某些標準才會被列為瀕危物種，例如族群數量快速下降。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B43","t":"標準"},{"w":"cycle","pos":"n.","def":"a series of events that happen again and again","cn":"循環；週期","s":"The life ________ of a salmon is amazing, because it is born in a river, lives in the sea and returns to the same river.","zh":"鮭魚的生命週期很驚人，因為牠在河中出生，在海裡生活，然後再回到同一條河。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B44","t":"週期"},{"w":"deduce","pos":"v.","def":"to reach a conclusion from the facts you have","cn":"推斷；推論","s":"From the footprints in the mud, the ranger ________ that a mother bear and two cubs had passed by that morning.","zh":"從泥巴上的腳印，巡山員推斷當天早上有一隻熊媽媽和兩隻小熊經過。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B45","t":"推斷"},{"w":"deny","pos":"v.","def":"to say that something is not true","cn":"否認","s":"The shop owner ________ selling illegal birds, but the police found several rare parrots hidden in the back room.","zh":"店主否認販售非法鳥類，但警方在後面的房間裡發現了好幾隻被藏起來的稀有鸚鵡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B46","t":"否認"},{"w":"deplete","pos":"v.","def":"to use up or greatly reduce the amount of something","cn":"耗盡；大量減少","s":"Overfishing has ________ the tuna in this part of the ocean, so the fishermen now have to sail much farther to catch anything.","zh":"過度捕撈已經耗盡了這片海域的鮪魚，所以漁民現在必須航行得更遠才能捕到魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B47","t":"耗盡"},{"w":"detect","pos":"v.","def":"to notice or discover something","cn":"偵測；察覺","s":"Hidden cameras can ________ animals that move at night, so scientists can study shy creatures without disturbing them.","zh":"隱藏式相機能偵測到夜間活動的動物，所以科學家可以在不打擾牠們的情況下研究害羞的生物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B48","t":"偵測"},{"w":"deviate","pos":"v.","def":"to move away from the usual way or plan","cn":"偏離","s":"Visitors must not ________ from the marked path, because rare plants and small animals live on the forest floor.","zh":"遊客不可以偏離標示的步道，因為稀有植物和小動物生活在森林地面上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B49","t":"偏離"},{"w":"device","pos":"n.","def":"a small machine or tool made for a purpose","cn":"裝置；設備","s":"The scientists attached a tiny ________ to the turtle's shell, and it sends its location to a satellite every day.","zh":"科學家在海龜的殼上裝了一個微小的裝置，它每天都會把位置傳送到衛星上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B50","t":"裝置"},{"w":"devote","pos":"v.","def":"to give your time or energy to something","cn":"致力於；奉獻","s":"Jane Goodall ________ her whole life to studying chimpanzees, and she taught the world how intelligent they are.","zh":"珍古德把她的一生都奉獻給黑猩猩的研究，她讓全世界知道牠們有多聰明。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B51","t":"奉獻"},{"w":"displace","pos":"v.","def":"to force people or animals to leave their home","cn":"迫使離開；取代","s":"The new dam ________ hundreds of families and animals, because the water covered the whole valley.","zh":"新水壩迫使數百個家庭和動物離開家園，因為水淹沒了整個山谷。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B52","t":"迫使 離開"},{"w":"dispose","pos":"v.","def":"to get rid of something","cn":"處理；丟棄","s":"Campers must ________ of their rubbish properly, because bears and monkeys are attracted to the smell of food.","zh":"露營者必須妥善處理垃圾，因為熊和猴子會被食物的氣味吸引。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B53","t":"處理"},{"w":"distort","pos":"v.","def":"to change facts so they are no longer true","cn":"扭曲；曲解","s":"Some websites ________ the facts about sharks to get more clicks, so many people are more afraid than they need to be.","zh":"有些網站為了獲得更多點閱而扭曲關於鯊魚的事實，使許多人產生不必要的恐懼。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B54","t":"扭曲"},{"w":"distribute","pos":"v.","def":"to give things to many people","cn":"分發；分配","s":"The volunteers ________ leaflets at the night market, and they explained why people should not buy wild animals.","zh":"志工們在夜市發放傳單，並解釋為什麼人們不應該購買野生動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B55","t":"發放"},{"w":"document","pos":"v.","def":"to record information in writing or with photos","cn":"記錄","s":"The photographer has ________ the life of a wild leopard family for five years, and his pictures are now in a book.","zh":"那位攝影師已經記錄一個野生豹家庭的生活五年了，他的照片現在已出版成書。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B56","t":"記錄"},{"w":"domestic","pos":"adj.","def":"kept by people at home or on a farm; tame","cn":"家養的；馴化的","s":"________ cats kill millions of wild birds every year, so experts suggest keeping pet cats indoors.","zh":"家貓每年殺死數百萬隻野鳥，所以專家建議把寵物貓養在室內。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B57","t":"家貓"},{"w":"dominate","pos":"v.","def":"to have the most power or importance","cn":"支配；主宰","s":"In the forest, one strong male gorilla ________ the group, and the others follow him when he moves.","zh":"在森林裡，一隻強壯的雄性大猩猩主宰整個群體，當牠移動時其他成員都會跟隨。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B58","t":"主宰"},{"w":"duration","pos":"n.","def":"the length of time something lasts","cn":"持續時間；期間","s":"For the ________ of the nesting season, dogs are not allowed on the beach, because they may dig up the eggs.","zh":"在築巢季的期間，狗不可以進入海灘，因為牠們可能會把蛋挖出來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B59","t":"期間"},{"w":"dynamic","pos":"adj.","def":"always changing and full of energy","cn":"動態的；充滿活力的","s":"A forest is a ________ system that changes every season, so scientists must visit it many times a year.","zh":"森林是一個每季都在改變的動態系統，所以科學家一年必須造訪許多次。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B60","t":"動態"},{"w":"emphasis","pos":"n.","def":"special importance given to something","cn":"強調；重點","s":"The new programme puts great ________ on education, because children who love nature will protect it when they grow up.","zh":"新計畫非常重視教育，因為熱愛自然的孩子長大後會保護它。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B61","t":"重視"},{"w":"encounter","pos":"n.","def":"a meeting that is unexpected","cn":"偶遇；邂逅","s":"My ________ with a wild bear on the mountain trail was frightening, but I stayed calm and slowly walked away.","zh":"我在山路上和一隻野生熊的不期而遇很可怕，但我保持冷靜並慢慢地走開。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B62","t":"不期而遇"},{"w":"entity","pos":"n.","def":"something that exists as a single unit","cn":"實體；個體","s":"The river and the forest should be seen as one ________, because what happens to the water also affects the trees and animals.","zh":"河流與森林應該被視為一個整體，因為水發生的事也會影響樹木和動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B63","t":"整體"},{"w":"erode","pos":"v.","def":"to slowly damage or wear away","cn":"侵蝕；逐漸削弱","s":"Strong waves continue to ________ the island's beaches, and soon there may be no sand left for turtles to nest in.","zh":"強浪持續侵蝕島上的海灘，不久之後可能就沒有沙子讓海龜築巢了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B64","t":"侵蝕"},{"w":"exceed","pos":"v.","def":"to be more than a limit or amount","cn":"超過；超出","s":"The number of tourists ________ the park's limit last weekend, so the rangers had to close the gate early.","zh":"上週末遊客人數超過了公園的上限，所以巡山員不得不提早關閉大門。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B65","t":"超過"},{"w":"exclude","pos":"v.","def":"to keep out or not include","cn":"排除；把……排除在外","s":"A special fence ________ foxes and cats from the area, so the small birds can raise their chicks safely.","zh":"一道特殊的圍籬把狐狸和貓排除在這個區域之外，讓小鳥們能安全地養育雛鳥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B66","t":"排除"},{"w":"exhibit","pos":"n.","def":"an object or display shown in a museum or zoo","cn":"展覽品；展示","s":"The new ________ at the museum shows the bones of a giant whale, and it also explains why whales need protection.","zh":"博物館的新展覽展示了一頭巨鯨的骨骼，同時也說明了為什麼鯨魚需要保護。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B67","t":"展覽"},{"w":"expose","pos":"v.","def":"to put someone or something in danger","cn":"使暴露於；使接觸","s":"Cutting down the trees ________ the soil to heavy rain, so the land quickly washes away into the river.","zh":"砍伐樹木會使土壤暴露在大雨之下，所以土地很快就被沖進河裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B68","t":"暴露"},{"w":"external","pos":"adj.","def":"coming from outside","cn":"外部的","s":"________ threats such as new roads and farms are pushing the animals into a smaller and smaller area.","zh":"新道路和農場等外部威脅正把動物們逼進越來越小的區域。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B69","t":"外部"},{"w":"extract","pos":"v.","def":"to take something out, often with effort","cn":"提取；開採","s":"Companies want to ________ oil from under the Arctic ice, but scientists warn that a spill could kill many seals and whales.","zh":"企業想從北極冰層下開採石油，但科學家警告漏油可能會害死許多海豹和鯨魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B70","t":"開採"},{"w":"feature","pos":"n.","def":"an important part or quality of something","cn":"特色；特徵","s":"The long neck is the most famous ________ of the giraffe, and it helps the animal eat leaves high up in the trees.","zh":"長脖子是長頸鹿最有名的特徵，它幫助這種動物吃到樹上高處的葉子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B71","t":"特徵"},{"w":"flexible","pos":"adj.","def":"able to change easily","cn":"有彈性的；靈活的","s":"Conservation plans must be ________, because the weather and the animals' behaviour can change from year to year.","zh":"保育計畫必須有彈性，因為天氣和動物的行為每年都可能改變。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B72","t":"有彈性"},{"w":"fluctuate","pos":"v.","def":"to go up and down often","cn":"波動；起伏","s":"The number of butterflies ________ from year to year, so scientists need data from many years to see the real trend.","zh":"蝴蝶的數量每年都會波動，所以科學家需要多年的資料才能看出真正的趨勢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B73","t":"波動"},{"w":"format","pos":"n.","def":"the way something is arranged or presented","cn":"格式；形式","s":"The wildlife report is available in a simple ________ for students, so even young readers can understand the main ideas.","zh":"這份野生動物報告有提供給學生的簡易格式版本，所以即使是年紀小的讀者也能了解主要內容。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B74","t":"格式"},{"w":"formula","pos":"n.","def":"a special mix of ingredients","cn":"配方","s":"The zoo developed a special milk ________ for the baby pangolin, because its mother could not feed it.","zh":"動物園為小穿山甲研發了一種特殊的奶粉配方，因為牠的媽媽無法餵養牠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B75","t":"配方"},{"w":"foundation","pos":"n.","def":"an organisation that gives money to good causes","cn":"基金會","s":"The ________ gives money to schools that teach children about wildlife, and it also supports rangers in Africa.","zh":"那個基金會捐款給教導孩子認識野生動物的學校，同時也支持非洲的巡山員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B76","t":"基金會"},{"w":"generate","pos":"v.","def":"to produce or create something","cn":"產生；創造","s":"Whale watching ________ a lot of income for the small fishing town, so the local people now protect the whales.","zh":"賞鯨為這個小漁村創造了大量收入，所以當地人現在都保護鯨魚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B77","t":"創造"},{"w":"global","pos":"adj.","def":"related to the whole world","cn":"全球的","s":"The loss of bees is a ________ problem, so countries need to share their research and work together.","zh":"蜜蜂消失是一個全球性的問題，所以各國需要分享研究並共同合作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B78","t":"全球性"},{"w":"grant","pos":"n.","def":"money given by a government or group for a purpose","cn":"補助金；獎助金","s":"The team received a large ________ from the government, so they can now buy cameras to study the leopard cats.","zh":"團隊從政府獲得了一大筆補助金，所以他們現在能購買相機來研究石虎。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B79","t":"補助金"},{"w":"guarantee","pos":"v.","def":"to promise that something will happen","cn":"保證；確保","s":"No one can ________ that the baby rhino will survive, but the vets are doing everything they can to help it.","zh":"沒有人能保證那隻犀牛寶寶能活下來，但獸醫們正盡一切所能地幫助牠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B80","t":"保證"},{"w":"hierarchy","pos":"n.","def":"a system where some members have more power than others","cn":"階級；等級制度","s":"Wolves live in a clear ________, and the strongest pair usually leads the pack and eats first.","zh":"狼生活在明確的階級制度中，而最強壯的一對通常帶領狼群並最先進食。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B81","t":"階級制度"},{"w":"ignorance","pos":"n.","def":"lack of knowledge about something","cn":"無知；不了解","s":"Many people harm wild animals out of ________ rather than cruelty, so education is an important part of conservation.","zh":"許多人傷害野生動物是出於無知而非殘忍，所以教育是保育中很重要的一環。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B82","t":"無知"},{"w":"incentive","pos":"n.","def":"something that encourages people to do something","cn":"誘因；激勵","s":"The government offers farmers an ________ to plant trees on their land, so more birds have places to live.","zh":"政府提供農民在自己的土地上種樹的誘因，讓更多鳥類有地方居住。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B83","t":"誘因"},{"w":"income","pos":"n.","def":"money that someone earns","cn":"收入","s":"Selling honey gives the villagers a steady ________, so they no longer need to cut down the forest for money.","zh":"販售蜂蜜為村民帶來穩定的收入，所以他們不再需要砍伐森林來賺錢。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B84","t":"收入"},{"w":"individual","pos":"n.","def":"a single person or animal","cn":"個體；個人","s":"Scientists can recognise each ________ whale by the shape of its tail, so they know which whales return every year.","zh":"科學家能從尾巴的形狀辨認出每一隻鯨魚個體，所以他們知道哪些鯨魚每年都會回來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B85","t":"個體"},{"w":"inhibit","pos":"v.","def":"to slow down or stop something","cn":"抑制；阻礙","s":"Cold water can ________ the growth of young fish, so the hatchery keeps the water at a warm temperature.","zh":"冷水會抑制幼魚的成長，所以孵化場會把水溫維持在溫暖的溫度。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B86","t":"抑制"},{"w":"initiate","pos":"v.","def":"to start something such as a plan","cn":"發起；開始實施","s":"The school ________ a project to plant trees along the river, and every student planted one tree on Earth Day.","zh":"學校發起了一項沿著河岸種樹的計畫，每位學生都在世界地球日種下一棵樹。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B87","t":"發起"},{"w":"initiative","pos":"n.","def":"a new plan to solve a problem","cn":"倡議；新措施","s":"The city's new ________ turns off street lights near the beach at night, so baby turtles can find their way to the sea.","zh":"市政府的新措施在夜間關閉海灘附近的路燈，讓小海龜能找到通往大海的路。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B88","t":"措施"},{"w":"insight","pos":"n.","def":"a deep and clear understanding of something","cn":"洞察；深刻見解","s":"The study gave scientists new ________ into how elephants talk to each other, because it recorded sounds too low for humans to hear.","zh":"這項研究讓科學家對大象如何彼此溝通有了新的見解，因為它錄下了低到人類聽不見的聲音。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B89","t":"見解"},{"w":"inspect","pos":"v.","def":"to look at something carefully to check it","cn":"檢查；視察","s":"Officers ________ every pet shop in the city twice a year, and they check whether any animals are illegal.","zh":"官員每年兩次檢查市內的每家寵物店，確認是否有任何非法動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B90","t":"檢查"},{"w":"instance","pos":"n.","def":"an example of something","cn":"例子；實例","s":"In one ________, a dog found forty turtle nests in a single morning, so the team now trains more dogs for this job.","zh":"在一個例子中，一隻狗在一個早上就找到了四十個海龜巢，所以團隊現在訓練更多的狗來做這項工作。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B91","t":"例子"},{"w":"integral","pos":"adj.","def":"necessary and important as part of a whole","cn":"不可或缺的；構成整體所必需的","s":"Local people are an ________ part of the project, because they know the forest better than anyone else.","zh":"當地居民是這項計畫不可或缺的一部分，因為他們比任何人都更了解這片森林。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B92","t":"不可或缺的"},{"w":"integrity","pos":"n.","def":"the state of being whole and not damaged","cn":"完整性","s":"The new highway would destroy the ________ of the forest, because it would cut the animals' home into two parts.","zh":"新高速公路會破壞森林的完整性，因為它會把動物的家園切成兩半。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B93","t":"完整性"},{"w":"intense","pos":"adj.","def":"very strong or extreme","cn":"強烈的；劇烈的","s":"The ________ heat this summer dried up many ponds, so the frogs had to find new places to lay their eggs.","zh":"今年夏天強烈的高溫使許多池塘乾涸，所以青蛙們必須找新的地方產卵。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B94","t":"強烈的"},{"w":"intensify","pos":"v.","def":"to become stronger or more serious","cn":"加強；加劇","s":"The police have ________ their checks at the airport, because more smugglers are trying to bring in rare reptiles.","zh":"警方已加強機場的檢查，因為越來越多走私者試圖帶入稀有的爬蟲類。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B95","t":"加強"},{"w":"internal","pos":"adj.","def":"inside something such as a body or group","cn":"內部的","s":"The vet used an X-ray to check for ________ injuries, because the turtle had been hit by a boat but looked fine outside.","zh":"獸醫用X光檢查是否有內部傷害，因為那隻海龜被船撞到了，但外表看起來沒事。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B96","t":"內部"},{"w":"isolate","pos":"v.","def":"to separate someone or something from others","cn":"隔離；孤立","s":"The sick birds were ________ from the others in a separate room, so the disease would not spread through the whole zoo.","zh":"生病的鳥被隔離在另一個房間，這樣疾病就不會傳遍整個動物園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B97","t":"隔離"},{"w":"issue","pos":"n.","def":"an important problem that people discuss","cn":"議題；問題","s":"Plastic in the ocean has become a major ________ in many countries, and some cities have stopped giving out free plastic bags.","zh":"海洋中的塑膠已成為許多國家的重大議題，有些城市已經停止提供免費塑膠袋。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B98","t":"議題"},{"w":"label","pos":"v.","def":"to describe someone or something with a word","cn":"把……稱為；貼上標籤","s":"People often ________ sharks as dangerous killers, but most sharks are shy and have never attacked a human.","zh":"人們常常把鯊魚貼上危險殺手的標籤，但大多數鯊魚都很害羞，而且從未攻擊過人類。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B99","t":"貼上 標籤"},{"w":"layer","pos":"n.","def":"a level of something that lies over or under another","cn":"層","s":"Whales have a thick ________ of fat under their skin, so they can stay warm even in very cold water.","zh":"鯨魚的皮膚下有一層厚厚的脂肪，所以即使在非常冰冷的水中也能保暖。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B100","t":"層"},{"w":"link","pos":"n.","def":"a connection between two things","cn":"關聯；連結","s":"Scientists found a clear ________ between warmer seas and the death of corals, so they are asking for faster action on climate.","zh":"科學家發現海水變暖與珊瑚死亡之間有明顯的關聯，所以他們呼籲更快採取氣候行動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B101","t":"關聯"},{"w":"locate","pos":"v.","def":"to find the exact position of something","cn":"找出……的位置","s":"The team used a drone to ________ the missing bear, and they found it resting near a river two kilometres away.","zh":"團隊用無人機找到了失蹤熊的位置，發現牠在兩公里外的河邊休息。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B102","t":"找到 位置"},{"w":"logic","pos":"n.","def":"a sensible way of thinking","cn":"邏輯；道理","s":"There is simple ________ behind protecting bees, because without them, many of our fruits and vegetables would not grow.","zh":"保護蜜蜂背後有個簡單的道理，因為沒有牠們，我們的許多水果和蔬菜就無法生長。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B103","t":"道理"},{"w":"manual","pos":"n.","def":"a book that tells you how to do something","cn":"手冊；指南","s":"Every new volunteer receives a ________ that explains how to handle injured birds, so they do not hurt the animals by mistake.","zh":"每位新志工都會收到一本手冊，說明如何處理受傷的鳥，以免他們不小心傷害到動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B104","t":"手冊"},{"w":"margin","pos":"n.","def":"the edge of an area","cn":"邊緣","s":"Many birds nest along the ________ of the lake, so boats are not allowed close to the shore in spring.","zh":"許多鳥類沿著湖的邊緣築巢，所以春天時船隻不得靠近岸邊。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B105","t":"邊緣"},{"w":"mental","pos":"adj.","def":"related to the mind","cn":"心理的；精神的","s":"Animals in small cages can suffer from ________ problems, so good zoos give them toys and puzzles to keep them busy.","zh":"關在小籠子裡的動物可能會出現心理問題，所以好的動物園會給牠們玩具和益智遊戲讓牠們保持忙碌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B106","t":"心理"},{"w":"minimal","pos":"adj.","def":"very small in amount","cn":"極少的；最小的","s":"The new tourist boats make ________ noise, so they do not frighten the dolphins swimming nearby.","zh":"新型觀光船只發出極小的噪音，所以不會嚇到附近游泳的海豚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B107","t":"極小的"},{"w":"motive","pos":"n.","def":"the reason why someone does something","cn":"動機","s":"Money is the main ________ for most poachers, so helping villagers find other jobs can reduce hunting.","zh":"金錢是大多數盜獵者的主要動機，所以幫助村民找到其他工作可以減少獵捕。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B108","t":"動機"},{"w":"mutual","pos":"adj.","def":"shared by two or more people or animals","cn":"互相的；共同的","s":"The clownfish and the sea anemone have a ________ relationship, because each one helps the other to survive.","zh":"小丑魚和海葵之間有一種互利的關係，因為彼此都幫助對方生存。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B109","t":"互利的"},{"w":"neutral","pos":"adj.","def":"not supporting either side in a disagreement","cn":"中立的","s":"The meeting was led by a ________ expert, so both the farmers and the conservation group felt their voices were heard.","zh":"會議由一位中立的專家主持，所以農民和保育團體都覺得自己的聲音被聽見了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B110","t":"中立的"},{"w":"nonetheless","pos":"adv.","def":"however; even so","cn":"儘管如此；然而","s":"The project faced many problems in its first year; ________, the team managed to save twenty baby turtles.","zh":"這項計畫在第一年遇到許多問題；儘管如此，團隊還是成功救了二十隻小海龜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B111","t":"儘管如此"},{"w":"norm","pos":"n.","def":"what is usual or expected","cn":"常態；規範","s":"Using reusable bags has become the ________ in many cities, and as a result less plastic ends up in the sea.","zh":"使用環保袋在許多城市已成為常態，因此流入海洋的塑膠變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B112","t":"常態"},{"w":"notion","pos":"n.","def":"an idea or belief","cn":"觀念；概念","s":"The ________ that zoos only exist for fun is out of date, because many zoos now help save endangered animals.","zh":"動物園只是為了娛樂而存在的觀念已經過時了，因為現在許多動物園都在幫助拯救瀕危動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B113","t":"觀念"},{"w":"obtain","pos":"v.","def":"to get something, often with effort","cn":"取得；獲得","s":"Researchers must ________ a special permit before they enter the protected area, and they must follow strict rules inside.","zh":"研究人員必須先取得特別許可才能進入保護區，而且在裡面必須遵守嚴格的規定。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B114","t":"取得"},{"w":"obvious","pos":"adj.","def":"easy to see or understand","cn":"明顯的","s":"It was ________ that the bird was sick, because it could not stand up and its feathers were dirty.","zh":"那隻鳥顯然生病了，因為牠無法站起來，羽毛也很髒。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B115","t":"顯然"},{"w":"occupy","pos":"v.","def":"to live in or use a place","cn":"占據；居住於","s":"The owls ________ an old building on the farm, and the farmer is happy because they catch the rats in his barn.","zh":"貓頭鷹占據了農場上的一棟舊建築，農夫很高興，因為牠們會抓穀倉裡的老鼠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B116","t":"占據"},{"w":"occur","pos":"v.","def":"to happen","cn":"發生","s":"Most attacks on livestock ________ at night, so farmers now bring their animals into safe pens before dark.","zh":"大部分對家畜的攻擊都發生在夜晚，所以農民現在會在天黑前把動物趕進安全的圍欄。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B117","t":"發生"},{"w":"offset","pos":"v.","def":"to balance one thing with another","cn":"抵銷；彌補","s":"The airline plants trees to ________ the pollution from its flights, but some experts say this is not enough.","zh":"那家航空公司種樹來抵銷航班造成的汙染，但有些專家說這樣還不夠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B118","t":"抵銷"},{"w":"ongoing","pos":"adj.","def":"still happening; continuing","cn":"進行中的；持續的","s":"The ________ study of the bears has lasted ten years, and it has taught us a lot about their eating habits.","zh":"對熊持續進行的研究已經持續了十年，它讓我們對牠們的飲食習慣了解很多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B119","t":"持續進行的"},{"w":"option","pos":"n.","def":"a choice you can make","cn":"選擇；選項","s":"Moving the elephants to another park was the only ________, because there was no longer enough food for them.","zh":"把大象遷到另一座公園是唯一的選擇，因為那裡已經沒有足夠的食物給牠們了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B120","t":"選擇"},{"w":"overall","pos":"adj.","def":"including everything; general","cn":"整體的；全面的","s":"The ________ number of storks has increased this year, although some smaller groups are still in danger.","zh":"今年鸛鳥的整體數量增加了，雖然有些較小的群體仍處於危險之中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B121","t":"整體"},{"w":"overseas","pos":"adj.","def":"in or from another country across the sea","cn":"海外的；國外的","s":"________ visitors love Taiwan's mountain birds, so guided birdwatching tours have become a popular business.","zh":"海外遊客很喜愛台灣的高山鳥類，所以導覽賞鳥行程已成為熱門的生意。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B122","t":"海外"},{"w":"parallel","pos":"adj.","def":"happening at the same time and similar","cn":"平行的；同時進行的","s":"The two countries are running ________ programmes to protect the same turtles, because the turtles swim between both coasts.","zh":"兩國正在進行平行的計畫來保護同一種海龜，因為這些海龜在兩國海岸之間游動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B123","t":"平行的"},{"w":"persist","pos":"v.","def":"to continue to exist for a long time","cn":"持續存在","s":"Chemicals from old pesticides can ________ in the soil for many years, so they still harm insects and birds today.","zh":"舊農藥中的化學物質可以在土壤中持續存在很多年，所以至今仍會傷害昆蟲和鳥類。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B124","t":"持續存在"},{"w":"phase","pos":"n.","def":"a stage in a process","cn":"階段","s":"In the first ________ of the project, the team will count the animals, and in the second they will plant new trees.","zh":"在計畫的第一階段，團隊將清點動物數量，第二階段則將種植新的樹木。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B125","t":"階段"},{"w":"policy","pos":"n.","def":"a plan of action agreed by a government or group","cn":"政策","s":"The new ________ bans single-use plastic in national parks, so visitors must bring their own bottles and bags.","zh":"新政策禁止在國家公園使用一次性塑膠，所以遊客必須自備水瓶和袋子。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B126","t":"政策"},{"w":"portion","pos":"n.","def":"a part of something larger","cn":"部分","s":"A large ________ of the money from ticket sales is used to protect the forest, so visiting the park also helps nature.","zh":"門票收入中很大一部分被用來保護森林，所以參觀公園也是在幫助大自然。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B127","t":"部分"},{"w":"precede","pos":"v.","def":"to happen before something else","cn":"在……之前發生","s":"A long dry season ________ the forest fire, so the trees and grass burned very quickly.","zh":"森林大火之前經歷了一段漫長的乾季，所以樹木和草很快就燒起來了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B128","t":"之前"},{"w":"predominant","pos":"adj.","def":"most common or strongest","cn":"主要的；占優勢的","s":"Pine is the ________ tree in this forest, and it provides food for many squirrels and birds.","zh":"松樹是這片森林中主要的樹種，它為許多松鼠和鳥類提供食物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B129","t":"主要的"},{"w":"preliminary","pos":"adj.","def":"coming before the main part; early","cn":"初步的","s":"________ results show that the number of leopard cats has increased, but the final report will come out next year.","zh":"初步結果顯示石虎的數量增加了，但最終報告將在明年發表。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B130","t":"初步"},{"w":"presume","pos":"v.","def":"to think something is true without proof","cn":"推測；假定","s":"The rangers ________ that the tiger crossed the river at night, because they found its footprints on the other side.","zh":"巡山員推測老虎在夜間渡過了河，因為他們在對岸發現了牠的腳印。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B131","t":"推測"},{"w":"priority","pos":"n.","def":"something that is more important than other things","cn":"優先事項","s":"Saving the last few kakapos is a top ________ for New Zealand, so the government spends a lot on the project.","zh":"拯救最後幾隻鴞鸚鵡是紐西蘭的首要優先事項，所以政府在這項計畫上投入了大量經費。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B132","t":"優先事項"},{"w":"proceed","pos":"v.","def":"to continue doing something","cn":"繼續進行","s":"The building work cannot ________ until the birds leave their nests, so the company has to wait until autumn.","zh":"在鳥兒離巢之前，建築工程無法繼續進行，所以公司必須等到秋天。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B133","t":"繼續進行"},{"w":"promote","pos":"v.","def":"to help something grow or become popular","cn":"促進；推廣","s":"The town wants to ________ ecotourism, so it is training local young people to become nature guides.","zh":"小鎮想要推廣生態旅遊，所以正在培訓當地年輕人成為自然導覽員。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B134","t":"推廣"},{"w":"prospect","pos":"n.","def":"the possibility that something will happen","cn":"前景；可能性","s":"The ________ of seeing wild whales attracts many tourists to Hualien, so boat companies there are very busy in summer.","zh":"看到野生鯨魚的可能性吸引了許多遊客前往花蓮，所以那裡的船公司夏天都非常忙碌。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B135","t":"可能性"},{"w":"protocol","pos":"n.","def":"a set of rules for how to do something","cn":"規範程序；協議","s":"The rescue team follows a strict ________ when they handle sick animals, because some diseases can spread to humans.","zh":"救援團隊在處理生病的動物時遵循嚴格的規範程序，因為有些疾病會傳染給人類。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B136","t":"規範程序"},{"w":"publish","pos":"v.","def":"to print or put information online for the public","cn":"發表；出版","s":"The scientists will ________ their research on dolphins next month, and they hope it will lead to better laws.","zh":"科學家們將在下個月發表他們對海豚的研究，並希望這能帶來更好的法律。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B137","t":"發表"},{"w":"pursue","pos":"v.","def":"to try to achieve something over a long time","cn":"追求；從事","s":"My cousin wants to ________ a career in marine biology, because she has loved sea animals since she was a child.","zh":"我表姊想要從事海洋生物學的工作，因為她從小就熱愛海洋動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B138","t":"從事"},{"w":"quantitative","pos":"adj.","def":"based on numbers and amounts","cn":"定量的；數量的","s":"The team collected ________ data on the number of eggs in each nest, so they could compare the results with last year.","zh":"團隊收集了每個巢中蛋數量的定量資料，這樣他們就能和去年的結果比較。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B139","t":"定量"},{"w":"radical","pos":"adj.","def":"very new and different; extreme","cn":"激進的；徹底的","s":"Some experts believe we need ________ changes in how we farm, because current methods are destroying too much wildlife.","zh":"有些專家認為我們需要徹底改變耕作方式，因為目前的方法摧毀了太多野生動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B140","t":"徹底"},{"w":"ratio","pos":"n.","def":"the relationship between two amounts","cn":"比例；比率","s":"The ________ of male to female turtles is changing, because warmer sand produces more female babies.","zh":"海龜的雄雌比例正在改變，因為較溫暖的沙子會孵出更多雌性小海龜。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B141","t":"比例"},{"w":"rational","pos":"adj.","def":"based on clear thinking, not feelings","cn":"理性的","s":"We need a ________ discussion about wild boars, because both the farmers and the animal lovers have strong feelings.","zh":"我們需要對山豬進行理性的討論，因為農民和愛護動物人士雙方的情緒都很強烈。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B142","t":"理性的"},{"w":"recover","pos":"v.","def":"to return to a normal or healthy state","cn":"恢復；復原","s":"The forest will take fifty years to ________ from the fire, but some small plants are already growing again.","zh":"這片森林需要五十年才能從大火中恢復，但有些小植物已經開始重新生長了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B143","t":"恢復"},{"w":"refine","pos":"v.","def":"to improve something by making small changes","cn":"改進；精煉","s":"The scientists ________ their camera traps after the first test, so now the photos are much clearer at night.","zh":"科學家們在第一次測試後改進了他們的自動相機，所以現在夜間的照片清晰許多。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B144","t":"改進"},{"w":"region","pos":"n.","def":"a large area of a country or the world","cn":"地區；區域","s":"This ________ of Africa has the largest number of elephants, so it is a key area for the fight against poaching.","zh":"非洲的這個地區擁有最多的大象，所以它是對抗盜獵的關鍵區域。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B145","t":"地區"},{"w":"register","pos":"v.","def":"to put a name on an official list","cn":"登記；註冊","s":"All pet owners must ________ their reptiles with the city, so the government knows which animals are kept in homes.","zh":"所有飼主都必須向市政府登記他們的爬蟲類寵物，這樣政府才知道哪些動物被飼養在家中。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B146","t":"登記"},{"w":"reinforce","pos":"v.","def":"to make something stronger","cn":"加強；強化","s":"The farmers ________ their fences with metal posts, because the wild boars had broken the old wooden ones.","zh":"農民們用金屬柱加強了他們的圍籬，因為山豬已經撞壞了舊的木頭圍籬。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B147","t":"加強"},{"w":"reject","pos":"v.","def":"to refuse to accept something","cn":"拒絕；否決","s":"The city council ________ the plan to build a hotel on the beach, because it would destroy the turtles' nesting area.","zh":"市議會否決了在海灘上蓋飯店的計畫，因為它會破壞海龜的築巢區。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B148","t":"否決"},{"w":"release","pos":"v.","def":"to let an animal go free","cn":"釋放；野放","s":"After two months of care, the team ________ the eagle back into the mountains, and everyone cheered as it flew away.","zh":"經過兩個月的照顧，團隊把老鷹野放回山林，當牠飛走時大家都歡呼了起來。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B149","t":"野放"},{"w":"reluctant","pos":"adj.","def":"not willing to do something","cn":"不情願的","s":"Some farmers are ________ to share their land with wild animals, because they worry about losing their crops.","zh":"有些農民不情願和野生動物分享他們的土地，因為他們擔心失去農作物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B150","t":"不情願"},{"w":"rely","pos":"v.","def":"to need or depend on someone or something","cn":"依賴；仰賴","s":"Many island birds ________ on one type of fruit tree for food, so they will suffer if that tree disappears.","zh":"許多島嶼鳥類仰賴單一種果樹作為食物，所以如果那種樹消失，牠們就會受苦。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B151","t":"仰賴"},{"w":"require","pos":"v.","def":"to need something","cn":"需要；要求","s":"Looking after a baby elephant ________ a lot of time and money, because it drinks milk every three hours.","zh":"照顧一隻小象需要大量的時間和金錢，因為牠每三個小時就要喝一次奶。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B152","t":"需要"},{"w":"reside","pos":"v.","def":"to live in a particular place","cn":"居住","s":"About two hundred black bears ________ in this national park, but they are rarely seen by hikers.","zh":"大約有兩百隻黑熊居住在這座國家公園裡，但健行者很少看到牠們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B153","t":"居住"},{"w":"restore","pos":"v.","def":"to bring something back to a good condition","cn":"恢復；修復","s":"Volunteers are working to ________ the old pond, so frogs and dragonflies can live there again.","zh":"志工們正在努力修復那座舊池塘，讓青蛙和蜻蜓能再次在那裡生活。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B154","t":"修復"},{"w":"reveal","pos":"v.","def":"to show something that was hidden","cn":"揭露；顯示","s":"The camera traps ________ that a rare cat lives in the forest, and the scientists were very excited by the news.","zh":"自動相機揭露了森林裡住著一種稀有的貓科動物，科學家們對這個消息感到非常興奮。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B155","t":"揭露"},{"w":"revenue","pos":"n.","def":"money that a business or government receives","cn":"收入；營收","s":"The park uses its ticket ________ to pay the rangers, so tourism directly supports the protection of wildlife.","zh":"公園用門票收入來支付巡山員的薪水，所以觀光直接支持了野生動物的保護。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B156","t":"收入"},{"w":"reverse","pos":"v.","def":"to change something back to how it was","cn":"扭轉；逆轉","s":"It is not too late to ________ the loss of our forests, but we must start planting trees and stop cutting them down.","zh":"要扭轉森林消失的趨勢還不算太晚，但我們必須開始種樹並停止砍伐。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B157","t":"扭轉"},{"w":"revise","pos":"v.","def":"to change something to improve or correct it","cn":"修改；修訂","s":"Every five years, the experts ________ the list of endangered species, and some animals are added while others are removed.","zh":"專家每五年修訂一次瀕危物種名單，有些動物被加進去，而有些則被移除。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B158","t":"修訂"},{"w":"rigid","pos":"adj.","def":"very strict and difficult to change","cn":"嚴格的；死板的","s":"The rules in the protected area are ________, so even scientists must ask for permission before they collect any plants.","zh":"保護區內的規定非常嚴格，所以即使是科學家在採集任何植物前也必須申請許可。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B159","t":"嚴格"},{"w":"route","pos":"n.","def":"the way from one place to another","cn":"路線","s":"The new railway will cut across the elephants' ________ to the river, so engineers are planning a tunnel for them.","zh":"新鐵路將切斷大象前往河邊的路線，所以工程師正在為牠們規劃一條隧道。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B160","t":"路線"},{"w":"scenario","pos":"n.","def":"a possible situation in the future","cn":"情境；可能的情況","s":"In the worst ________, the island's rare birds could disappear within ten years, so action must be taken now.","zh":"在最壞的情況下，島上的稀有鳥類可能在十年內消失，所以現在就必須採取行動。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B161","t":"情況"},{"w":"scheme","pos":"n.","def":"an official plan or programme","cn":"計畫；方案","s":"Under the new ________, farmers get money for every leopard cat seen on their land, so they now protect the animals.","zh":"在新方案下，農民在自己的土地上每發現一隻石虎就能獲得獎金，所以他們現在都會保護這種動物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B162","t":"方案"},{"w":"scope","pos":"n.","def":"the range of things that something covers","cn":"範圍","s":"The ________ of the study is quite small, because the scientists only looked at birds in one city park.","zh":"這項研究的範圍相當小，因為科學家只觀察了一座城市公園裡的鳥。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B163","t":"範圍"},{"w":"secure","pos":"v.","def":"to get something important after effort","cn":"取得；爭取到","s":"The charity finally ________ enough money to buy the forest, so it will never be cut down.","zh":"那個慈善機構終於爭取到足夠的資金買下那片森林，所以它永遠不會被砍伐了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B164","t":"爭取到"},{"w":"seek / sought / sought","pos":"v.","def":"to try to find or get something","cn":"尋求；尋找","s":"During the drought, many animals ________ water in nearby villages, which led to conflicts with farmers.","zh":"乾旱期間，許多動物到附近村莊尋找水源，因而和農民發生衝突。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B165","t":"尋找"},{"w":"sequence","pos":"n.","def":"a series of events in a particular order","cn":"順序；一連串","s":"Scientists studied the ________ of events that led to the fish deaths, and they found that the problem began at a factory.","zh":"科學家研究了導致魚群死亡的一連串事件，發現問題始於一家工廠。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B166","t":"連串"},{"w":"series","pos":"n.","def":"a number of similar things that come one after another","cn":"系列；一連串","s":"The BBC made a nature ________ about the ocean, and it made millions of viewers care about plastic pollution.","zh":"英國廣播公司製作了一部關於海洋的自然系列節目，讓數百萬觀眾開始關心塑膠汙染。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B167","t":"系列"},{"w":"site","pos":"n.","def":"a place where something is or happens","cn":"地點；場所","s":"The beach is an important nesting ________ for green turtles, so it is closed to the public from May to October.","zh":"這片海灘是綠蠵龜重要的築巢地點，所以從五月到十月不對外開放。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B168","t":"地點"},{"w":"sole","pos":"adj.","def":"only; single","cn":"唯一的","s":"The kakapo's ________ defence is to stay still and hide, but this does not work against cats and rats.","zh":"鴞鸚鵡唯一的防禦方式就是靜止不動並躲藏，但這招對貓和老鼠沒有用。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B169","t":"唯一的"},{"w":"somewhat","pos":"adv.","def":"a little; to some degree","cn":"有點；稍微","s":"The number of visitors has dropped ________ since the new rules began, but the animals seem much calmer now.","zh":"自從新規定實施以來，遊客人數稍微減少了，但動物們現在似乎平靜多了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B170","t":"稍微"},{"w":"source","pos":"n.","def":"the place where something comes from","cn":"來源","s":"Insects are the main food ________ for many birds, so fewer insects means fewer birds in the countryside.","zh":"昆蟲是許多鳥類主要的食物來源，所以昆蟲變少就代表鄉間的鳥類也會變少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B171","t":"來源"},{"w":"specific","pos":"adj.","def":"exact and clear; particular","cn":"特定的；明確的","s":"Each type of butterfly needs a ________ plant to lay its eggs on, so gardeners should grow many kinds of local plants.","zh":"每一種蝴蝶都需要一種特定的植物來產卵，所以園丁應該種植多種本地植物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B172","t":"特定的"},{"w":"stable","pos":"adj.","def":"not changing much; steady","cn":"穩定的","s":"The number of gorillas in the park has been ________ for five years, so the rangers feel hopeful about the future.","zh":"公園裡大猩猩的數量五年來一直保持穩定，所以巡山員對未來感到有希望。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B173","t":"穩定"},{"w":"status","pos":"n.","def":"official position or condition","cn":"地位；狀態","s":"The giant panda's ________ changed from endangered to vulnerable in 2016, because its numbers had slowly increased.","zh":"大貓熊的保育狀態在2016年從瀕危降為易危，因為牠們的數量已經慢慢增加了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B174","t":"狀態"},{"w":"submit","pos":"v.","def":"to give a document to someone for a decision","cn":"提交；呈交","s":"Our class ________ a proposal to the principal, and we asked for a small garden for bees and butterflies at school.","zh":"我們班向校長提交了一份提案，請求在學校設置一座小型的蜜蜂和蝴蝶花園。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B175","t":"提交"},{"w":"subsidy","pos":"n.","def":"money a government pays to help reduce costs","cn":"補貼；津貼","s":"Farmers who stop using pesticides can receive a ________ from the government, so their income does not drop.","zh":"停止使用農藥的農民可以獲得政府的補貼，讓他們的收入不會減少。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B176","t":"補貼"},{"w":"substitute","pos":"n.","def":"something used instead of another thing","cn":"替代品","s":"Scientists are developing a plant-based ________ for rhino horn, because they hope it will reduce the demand for real horns.","zh":"科學家正在開發一種植物性的犀牛角替代品，因為他們希望這能減少對真犀牛角的需求。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B177","t":"替代品"},{"w":"supplement","pos":"v.","def":"to add something to make it better or complete","cn":"補充；增補","s":"In winter, the zoo ________ the birds' food with extra seeds, because there are fewer insects for them to eat.","zh":"冬天時，動物園會用額外的種子來補充鳥的食物，因為可以吃的昆蟲變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B178","t":"補充"},{"w":"survive","pos":"v.","def":"to continue to live, especially after danger","cn":"存活；倖存","s":"Only a few baby turtles ________ their first year, because so many animals in the sea want to eat them.","zh":"只有少數幾隻小海龜能存活過第一年，因為海裡有太多動物想吃牠們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B179","t":"存活"},{"w":"suspend","pos":"v.","def":"to stop something for a period of time","cn":"暫停；中止","s":"The city ________ the building work near the lake, because a family of rare otters was found living there.","zh":"市政府暫停了湖邊的建築工程，因為發現一家稀有的水獺住在那裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B180","t":"暫停"},{"w":"sustain","pos":"v.","def":"to keep something alive or continuing","cn":"維持；支撐","s":"The small forest cannot ________ so many deer, so the animals are eating all the young trees.","zh":"這片小森林無法維持那麼多鹿的生存，所以這些動物正在吃光所有的小樹。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B181","t":"維持"},{"w":"symbol","pos":"n.","def":"something that represents an idea","cn":"象徵；標誌","s":"The giant panda has become a ________ of wildlife protection, and its picture appears on the WWF logo.","zh":"大貓熊已經成為野生動物保護的象徵，牠的圖案出現在世界自然基金會的標誌上。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B182","t":"象徵"},{"w":"target","pos":"n.","def":"a goal you want to achieve","cn":"目標","s":"The country set a ________ of protecting thirty percent of its land, and it hopes to reach this goal by 2030.","zh":"這個國家設定了保護百分之三十國土的目標，並希望在2030年前達成。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B183","t":"目標"},{"w":"temporary","pos":"adj.","def":"lasting only for a short time","cn":"暫時的；臨時的","s":"The injured deer was kept in a ________ shelter, and it was released once its leg had healed.","zh":"受傷的鹿被安置在一個臨時收容所，等腿傷痊癒後就被野放了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B184","t":"臨時"},{"w":"terminate","pos":"v.","def":"to end something","cn":"終止；結束","s":"The government ________ the company's fishing licence, because it had caught dolphins again and again.","zh":"政府終止了那家公司的捕魚執照，因為它一再捕捉到海豚。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B185","t":"終止"},{"w":"tradition","pos":"n.","def":"a belief or custom passed down for many years","cn":"傳統","s":"In some cultures, eating wild animals is an old ________, so changing people's habits takes patience and respect.","zh":"在某些文化中，吃野生動物是一種古老的傳統，所以改變人們的習慣需要耐心和尊重。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B186","t":"傳統"},{"w":"ultimate","pos":"adj.","def":"final and most important","cn":"最終的；終極的","s":"The ________ goal of the breeding programme is to return the animals to the wild, not to keep them in zoos forever.","zh":"繁殖計畫的最終目標是讓動物回歸野外，而不是讓牠們永遠待在動物園裡。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B187","t":"最終"},{"w":"undergo / underwent / undergone","pos":"v.","def":"to experience a process or change","cn":"經歷；接受（治療等）","s":"The injured dolphin ________ surgery last week, and the vets say it is now eating and swimming normally.","zh":"那隻受傷的海豚上週接受了手術，獸醫說牠現在已經能正常進食和游泳了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B188","t":"接受"},{"w":"underlie / underlay / underlain","pos":"v.","def":"to be the real cause of something","cn":"構成……的基礎；是……的根本原因","s":"Poverty often ________ the problem of poaching, because hunters need money to feed their families.","zh":"貧窮往往是盜獵問題的根本原因，因為獵人需要錢來養家。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B189","t":"根本原因"},{"w":"uniform","pos":"adj.","def":"the same in all parts or at all times","cn":"一致的；統一的","s":"There is no ________ rule for keeping exotic pets, because each country has its own laws.","zh":"飼養奇特寵物並沒有統一的規定，因為每個國家都有自己的法律。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B190","t":"統一的"},{"w":"unique","pos":"adj.","def":"being the only one of its kind","cn":"獨特的；獨一無二的","s":"Every zebra has a ________ pattern of stripes, so scientists can use photos to tell the animals apart.","zh":"每隻斑馬都有獨一無二的條紋圖案，所以科學家可以用照片來區分牠們。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B191","t":"獨一無二的"},{"w":"utilise","pos":"v.","def":"to use something in an effective way","cn":"利用；使用","s":"Rangers in the park now ________ smartphones to report poachers quickly, so help can arrive within minutes.","zh":"園區的巡山員現在利用智慧型手機迅速通報盜獵者，讓支援能在幾分鐘內抵達。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B192","t":"利用"},{"w":"vary","pos":"v.","def":"to be different in different situations","cn":"變化；不同","s":"The size of a bear's territory can ________ a lot, because it depends on how much food is available.","zh":"熊的領域大小可能差異很大，因為這取決於有多少可取得的食物。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B193","t":"差異"},{"w":"violate","pos":"v.","def":"to break a law or rule","cn":"違反；違背","s":"The tour company ________ the rules by getting too close to the whales, so it had to pay a large fine.","zh":"那家旅遊公司因為太靠近鯨魚而違反規定，所以必須支付一大筆罰款。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B194","t":"違反"},{"w":"visible","pos":"adj.","def":"able to be seen","cn":"看得見的；明顯的","s":"The damage from the oil spill was clearly ________ from the air, and black water stretched for kilometres along the coast.","zh":"漏油造成的損害從空中清楚可見，黑色的海水沿著海岸延伸了好幾公里。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B195","t":"可見"},{"w":"voluntary","pos":"adj.","def":"done because you choose to, not because you must","cn":"自願的","s":"The beach clean-up is ________, but more than two hundred students joined it last Saturday.","zh":"淨灘活動是自願參加的，但上週六有超過兩百名學生加入。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B196","t":"自願"},{"w":"welfare","pos":"n.","def":"the health and happiness of people or animals","cn":"福利；福祉","s":"Good zoos care about the ________ of their animals, so they give them large spaces and a natural diet.","zh":"好的動物園關心動物的福祉，所以會給牠們寬敞的空間和自然的飲食。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B197","t":"福祉"},{"w":"accelerate","pos":"v.","def":"to happen or make happen faster","cn":"加速","s":"Warmer weather has ________ the melting of the Arctic ice, so polar bears have less time to hunt each year.","zh":"較暖的天氣加速了北極冰層的融化，所以北極熊每年能狩獵的時間變少了。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B198","t":"加速"},{"w":"decade","pos":"n.","def":"a period of ten years","cn":"十年","s":"Over the last ________, the number of black-faced spoonbills has more than doubled, thanks to the hard work of many countries.","zh":"在過去十年間，黑面琵鷺的數量增加了一倍以上，這要歸功於許多國家的努力。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B199","t":"十年"},{"w":"bond","pos":"n.","def":"a close connection between people or animals","cn":"聯繫；情感連結","s":"The ________ between a mother orangutan and her baby is very strong, because the baby stays with her for about eight years.","zh":"紅毛猩猩媽媽和寶寶之間的情感連結非常緊密，因為寶寶會和媽媽待在一起大約八年。","part":"B","sec":"Part B 學術單字","lab":"B200","t":"情感連結"},{"w":"on the brink of extinction","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"very close to disappearing forever","cn":"瀕臨滅絕","s":"The vaquita porpoise is ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, because only about ten of them are left in the sea near Mexico.","zh":"小頭鼠海豚瀕臨滅絕，因為墨西哥附近的海域只剩下大約十隻。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P1","t":"瀕臨滅絕"},{"w":"in the wild","pos":"phr.","def":"living free in nature, not in a zoo","cn":"在野外","s":"Pandas live for about twenty years ______ ______ ______, but they can live longer in zoos because they get medical care.","zh":"貓熊在野外大約能活二十年，但在動物園裡因為能得到醫療照顧，所以可以活得更久。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P2","t":"在野外"},{"w":"food chain","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the order in which animals eat other plants and animals","cn":"食物鏈","s":"Sharks are at the top of the ocean ______ ______, so when they disappear, the whole sea can become unbalanced.","zh":"鯊魚位於海洋食物鏈的頂端，所以當牠們消失時，整個海洋都可能失去平衡。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P3","t":"食物鏈"},{"w":"natural habitat","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the place where an animal normally lives in nature","cn":"自然棲地","s":"The zoo tries to make the gorillas' home look like their ______ ______, so it has planted tall trees and thick bushes.","zh":"動物園試著讓大猩猩的家看起來像牠們的自然棲地，所以種了高大的樹木和茂密的灌木。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P4","t":"自然棲地"},{"w":"habitat loss","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the destruction of the places where animals live","cn":"棲地喪失","s":"______ ______ is the biggest danger for orangutans, because their forests are being replaced by palm oil farms.","zh":"棲地喪失是紅毛猩猩面臨的最大危險，因為牠們的森林正被棕櫚油農園取代。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P5","t":"棲地喪失"},{"w":"climate change","pos":"n.phr.","def":"long-term changes in the Earth's weather and temperature","cn":"氣候變遷","s":"______ ______ is making the sea warmer, so many corals are dying and fish are moving to cooler waters.","zh":"氣候變遷正使海水變暖，所以許多珊瑚正在死亡，魚群也正移往較涼的水域。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P6","t":"氣候變遷"},{"w":"keystone species","pos":"n.phr.","def":"an animal that many other species depend on","cn":"關鍵物種","s":"The sea otter is a ______ ______, because it eats sea urchins that would otherwise destroy the kelp forests.","zh":"海獺是一種關鍵物種，因為牠會吃掉海膽，否則海膽會摧毀海藻森林。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P7","t":"關鍵物種"},{"w":"human-wildlife conflict","pos":"n.phr.","def":"problems that happen when people and wild animals meet","cn":"人與野生動物的衝突","s":"______ ______ is growing in Kenya, because more farms are being built on land where elephants used to walk.","zh":"人與野生動物的衝突在肯亞日益加劇，因為越來越多農場蓋在大象過去行走的土地上。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P8","t":"人與野生動物的衝突"},{"w":"die out","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to disappear completely","cn":"絕跡；滅絕","s":"The dodo ______ ______ in the 1600s, because sailors hunted it and the animals they brought ate its eggs.","zh":"渡渡鳥在十七世紀絕跡了，因為水手們獵捕牠，而他們帶來的動物則吃掉了牠的蛋。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P9","t":"絕跡"},{"w":"wipe out","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to destroy or kill something completely","cn":"徹底消滅","s":"A single disease could ______ ______ the whole population of Tasmanian devils, so scientists keep some healthy ones on a safe island.","zh":"單一種疾病就可能徹底消滅所有的袋獾，所以科學家把一些健康的袋獾養在一座安全的島上。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P10","t":"徹底消滅"},{"w":"pose a threat to","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to be a danger to something","cn":"對……構成威脅","s":"Stray cats ______ ______ ______ ______ the small birds on the island, because they hunt them day and night.","zh":"流浪貓對島上的小鳥構成威脅，因為牠們日夜都在獵捕鳥類。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P11","t":"對 構成威脅"},{"w":"make a comeback","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to become common or successful again","cn":"捲土重來；重新出現","s":"The bald eagle has ______ ______ ______ in the United States, because the harmful pesticide DDT was banned in 1972.","zh":"白頭海鵰已經在美國重新出現，因為有害的農藥DDT在1972年被禁用了。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P12","t":"重新出現"},{"w":"strike a balance","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to find a fair middle point between two things","cn":"取得平衡","s":"The town is trying to ______ ______ ______ between tourism and nature, so it limits the number of boats near the dolphins.","zh":"小鎮正努力在觀光與自然之間取得平衡，所以限制了靠近海豚的船隻數量。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P13","t":"取得平衡"},{"w":"under threat","pos":"phr.","def":"in danger of being harmed or destroyed","cn":"受到威脅","s":"Many wetlands in Asia are ______ ______ from new buildings, so migrating birds are losing their resting places.","zh":"亞洲許多濕地正受到新建築的威脅，所以遷徙的鳥類正逐漸失去牠們的休息地。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P14","t":"受到 威脅"},{"w":"at risk of","pos":"phr.","def":"likely to suffer something bad","cn":"有……的危險","s":"Without help, the Formosan leopard cat is ______ ______ ______ disappearing from Taiwan, so people must drive slowly on mountain roads.","zh":"如果沒有協助，石虎有從台灣消失的危險，所以人們在山區道路上必須慢慢開車。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P15","t":"有 的危險"},{"w":"take action","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to do something to solve a problem","cn":"採取行動","s":"If we do not ______ ______ now, our children may only see tigers in books, so everyone should help in small ways.","zh":"如果我們現在不採取行動，我們的孩子可能只能在書中看到老虎，所以每個人都應該盡一點小小的心力。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P16","t":"採取行動"},{"w":"a drop in the ocean","pos":"n.phr.","def":"a very small amount compared with what is needed","cn":"杯水車薪；滄海一粟","s":"One beach clean-up may seem like ______ ______ ______ ______ ______, but if everyone joins in, the difference can be huge.","zh":"一次淨灘看起來也許只是杯水車薪，但如果每個人都參與，差別就會非常大。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P17","t":"杯水車薪"},{"w":"turn a blind eye to","pos":"v.phr.","def":"to pretend not to notice something wrong","cn":"視而不見；睜一隻眼閉一隻眼","s":"Some officers ______ ______ ______ ______ ______ the illegal pet shops, so the animal trade continues in the city.","zh":"有些官員對非法寵物店視而不見，所以動物交易在城市裡持續進行。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P18","t":"視而不見"},{"w":"the balance of nature","pos":"n.phr.","def":"the natural state in which plants and animals live together steadily","cn":"自然平衡；生態平衡","s":"When wolves were removed from the park, ______ ______ ______ ______ was broken, and the deer ate too many young trees.","zh":"當狼被移出公園後，生態平衡就被破壞了，鹿吃掉了太多小樹。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P19","t":"生態平衡"},{"w":"dead as a dodo","pos":"adj.phr.","def":"completely gone or no longer existing","cn":"徹底消失的；過時的","s":"If we keep cutting down the rainforest, many amazing animals will soon be ______ ______ ______ ______, and we can never bring them back.","zh":"如果我們持續砍伐雨林，許多令人驚嘆的動物很快就會徹底消失，而且我們再也無法讓牠們回來。","part":"C","sec":"Part C 固定片語","lab":"P20","t":"徹底消失"}]};
